<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mak Na’ayen Yelehun som golihug la pĩ’ĩl la ŋwala</para>
  <para style="toc2">MAK</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Na’ayen Yelehun som golihug la pĩ’ĩl la ŋwala</para>
  <para style="imt1">Pĩ'ĩlug</para>
  <para style="ip">MAK Na’ayen Yelehun-som golihug la pĩ’ĩl la ŋwala, &lt;&lt;Yelehun-som la tɔɣɔra Yezu Krista, Na’ayen Dawɔɔ la yela.&gt;&gt; Ti behit Yezu ka U a la so n nɔŋ tooma ka tar kpe’eoŋ. Ti nyɛt U kpe’eoŋ la la U pa’alug ni, U paŋ n tɔ̃ kolekpãbɛ’ɛh, ni U suguru dii tet nirib yit ba yelebe’et poŋi. Yezu yet yi U a la Asaal Dawɔɔ, so n tana yi U zaŋ U vom fãã nirib ba yelebe’et poŋi bah.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mak golih Yezu yela wa la ntɔɔ ni mi’ilim, pa’an yit Yezu itug ni, ka ka’ la Un da tɔɣɔ bee pa’an se’em. Un yel Geon Baptis yel, ni soob la, ni Yezu makir la bɛ’ɛla la, u lɔŋa Yezu tooma la, ka U tebit ka pa’an la. Saŋa n da pa’ah la, Yezu nya’andolib la da pana bɔk U somma, ka seba n da pu bɔɔt U yela la, da yaa U gaara zã’ã. Golihuga ba’ahug ni la, pa’an na Yezu yela la, U bakɔ’ɔr zã’ã daan teŋa zugu la, ka poɣun sɔ̃ U mpuuredɔɔg zugu kpa’a ni U vo’ogum dɔɔ la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Golihuga ba’ahug niŋa n bɔk buyi kɔk lebih ha la, nirib yet yi so n golih lan, ka la ka Mak mɛŋa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Golihug la n Dol Se’em</para>
  <para style="io1">Yelesomir la pĩ’ĩlug (1.1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu peelumi tooma la Galilii teŋi (1.14—9.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zɛ’ɛl Galili yɛ Geruzalɛm (10.1-52)</para>
  <para style="io1">U bakɔi zã’ã daan la Geruzalɛm ni kɔrunkɔrum ni (11. 1—15.47)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu vo’o dɔɔ la (16.1-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Daan la nɛɛgim Mɛŋ ni Tensoŋ doo la (16.9-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Geon Baptis yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Yezu Krista n a Na’ayen Dawɔɔ la Yelesoma la pi’ilug.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Maɣah wuu Azaaya Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛhit la n golih se’em la, wolemaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;&lt;Mam tomit la N ntomit yi u gaat I tɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ti maal sɔr la te I;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />so nkɔr n kaahit sɛ̃ɣir la ni baɣa baɣa yet yii,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">&lt;Maahum Daan la sɔr la, ka tẽẽ U sɔya la ntɔɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Geon Baptis nɛɛ u mɛŋ sɛ̃ɣir la niŋa, ka tɔɔn vom tɛɛgir ni suguru dii yela. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Geudiya nirib zã’ã ni ba kɔrunkɔrum teh la zã’ã laɣum ni Geruzalɛm nirib da yitin ken u sa’ani ka u tet ba soob Geɔdan mɔɣir la ni, ka nirib da ki’ihit ba yelebe’et. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Geon ningbiŋ lauk da aa woɣun kɔ̃bit ka u sɛgbaŋ a gbauŋ, u diit da a la nta’aba ni mɔɔgin sĩĩt. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />U da tɔɔn yet yii, &lt;&lt;So n be mam nya’aŋ kenna la tar kpe’eoŋ gaat mam, ka mam poɣum pu sɛk yi n dɔ̃bel U tɔɔn lorig U taɣara miihe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mam tet ya la Na’ayen soob ni kɔ’ɔm; ka Ɔŋ nan so ya ni Vo’ohun Som Sii la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Na’ayen Soob tee ni U Makir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Dabih aŋ ni la, Yezu da zɛ’ɛl la Nazarɛt n be Galilii teŋ la tana, ka Geon da te U Na’ayen soob Geɔdan mɔɣir la ni. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ka Un da dɔɔ kɔ’ɔm la ni doot na la, U da nyɛ ka sangbana wo’o ka Vo’ohun Som Sii la sigit na a aa nangban la, yaɣel U zugu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ka nkɔr da yi saazugum na yet yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a Mam Dawɔnɔŋirig, I zugu ka Mam nyɛt popeelum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Vo’ohun Som Sii la da tar Yezu kalam yi keŋ sɛ̃k la ni ha. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />U da be la sɛ̃k mɛŋ ni dabiha pihinaahi, ka sitaana maɣahit U, ka U da be ni yeog dumih, ka Na’ayen maleka-nam la gur U.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Pĩ’ĩl U Tooma ka Bɔɔl U yiiga Nya’andolib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ba n da gba’a Geon ba’ah la, Yezu da tã Galilii na tɔɔn Na’ayen Yelesoma la, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;saŋa la paa ya, Na’ayen tensoŋ la vurih du mi na, ki’i mi ya yelebe’et ka sak sera te Na’ayen Yelesoma la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yezu n da dol mɔɣir la bɔba gat la, U da nyɛ Simɔn ni u sɔ̃ɔ̃g Andiru ka ba lobit woɣih mɔɣir la ni, ban a zingba’arib la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Dolin Mam na ka N nan bah ka ya kã’ãhit nirib.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Kalam ma, ba da zaŋ ba woɣih la bah ka dol U. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Un da keŋ gaat tɔɔn bɛ’ɛla la, U da nyɛ Gemis n a Zebedii dawɔɔ la ni u sɔ̃ɔ̃g Geon, ka ba be ba ããruŋ niŋa ligit ba woɣih. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />U da bɔɔl bam mi kalam; ka ba da bah ba ba’ Zebedii ããruŋ la ni, ni u ntomerib la, ka dolih Yezu keŋ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bura so da tar Sibɛ’ɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ba da keŋ la Kapanaum teŋin ka Yezu da pa’an ba yendobil la ni, la mi da a la voohug daar. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ŋwala da iŋ niriseba n da womihit la la pakir, den zugu, U pa’alug la da tar kpe’eoŋ ka pu ŋman ni wara pa’an pa’alib seba ka ba ni womihit la. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Bura se’e n da tar sibɛ’ɛ ka be yendobil la ni womihit Yezu pa’alug la, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />da kaah suppi yet yii, &lt;&lt;I bɔɔra nan ti sa’ani, Yezu Nazarɛt teŋ nira? I tana yi I sa’am ti mi? Mam mi nyɛ n a so, I a la Kassi Daan yi Na’ayen sa’ani na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ka Yezu da tãh sũi yii, &lt;&lt;ŋmɛkum i nɔɔra bããlam ka yi buraaga ni na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ka sibɛ’ɛga da zugum buraaga ni paŋ ka kaah suppi ka yi ŋwala vugubi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Nirikooŋ la zã’ã da iŋ la lɛɣibi ni yel la, ka zɛ’ bora bɔ’ɔhit taaba yet yii, &lt;&lt;Lan n ŋwala? Pa’al sããuŋ n tar kpe’eoŋ! Hali sibɛ’ɛh nan ni ka dol U nɔɔr.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Yezu wo’or da yi mi tii Galilii ni ka kɔrunkɔrum zã’ã.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb niribabug Simɔn yir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ban kɔ’ɔn da bah po’ohug dobil la, bam ni Gemis ni Geon da keŋ ti kpɛ̃ la Simɔn ni Andiru nam yir. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Saŋ kãã la wa, Simɔn dɛɛmpɔk da dɔ la doog ni gbi’it ni ɔɔt, ka ba da yel Yezu ka U pu go’om. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />U da tana gĩ bompɔka nu’ug darig u dɔɔ. Ka u ɔɔt la bah u ka u da dɛ’ɛ ba saan. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Zaanɔden la, ba da tar seba woo n bẽ’ẽt bee kolekpãbɛ’ɛh n dol ba la, tã U sa’ani na. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ka teŋ la nirib zã’ã da laɣah zanɔrin la. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Ka Yezu da teb seba woo n bẽ’ẽt ni bã’ãh buuri buuri la ka ba nyɛ ba nima’ahum; Ka kar kolekpãbɛ’ɛh yih badem sa’ani ka U mi da pu sak yi kolekpãbɛ’ɛh la tɔɣɔ, bam n mi U la zugu.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pa’alug Galilii poŋi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Beogin wo’oŋ wo’oŋ ka sɔ̃ɔ̃rum nan pu nyeege, ka Yezu da yi keŋ zĩ se’e n a suramm ti po’ohit. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Ka Simɔn ni u taab mi yina ɛɛt U. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ban da nyɛ U la ba da yel U mi yii, &lt;&lt;nir woo ɛɛt I mi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ka Yezu da lebih yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka ti keŋ tenkpɛ’ɛh la, ti tɔɣɔ Na’ayen yela la pa’al bam mi; ka den zugu ka Mam tana wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />U da dolih Galilii so’olum zã’ã tɔɔn Yelesoma la Geudem yempo’og dobibih ni, ka mi kat kolekpãbɛ’ɛh bahit.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb nin-sa’auŋ daan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Nin-sa’auŋ daan n da tã Yezu sa’ani na kpã duna belimit U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ m behih ka la a somma, nyɛn tebum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yel la da vɛ̃k Yezu sũũr mi, ni nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g ka U tɛ̃ɛ̃ nu’ug kalim nira ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam bɔɔt yi N teb i ka i a fassi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Nin-sa’auŋ daana da nyɛ u tebuk nila nila ka u ningbiŋ leb saalim. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yezu da kpa’am u ka yel u yi u kema. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />U da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Behima, da yel so se’el se’ela, ka kem ti zaŋ i mɛŋ pa’al Na’ayen kããbug kpɛm la, ka tar laɣase’et ka Moozis da pa’al yi ŋwala n nan a i sera dii, tet nirikooŋ zã’ã ka ba nan baŋ yi i nyɛ tebuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ka nira n da ti yi ba’ah la, u da kɔ’ɔm tɔɔn ni zĩ’ĩ woo, bah ka Yezu da pu le nyaŋ nɛɛgit U mɛŋ yit kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t teh la nii, nirib da zɛ’ɛl zĩ’ĩ woo ken U sa’ani mi na.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Kaaruŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Yezu n da leb Kapanaum teŋ la ni na la, la da iŋa dabiha bɛ’ɛla wa ka lahabar da ti yerig zĩ’ĩ woo yet yi U be yirin. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ka nirib zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ da ti tana pɛ’ɛl zĩ’ĩ woo yir la ni ti paa doog nɔɔrin; ka Yezu da pa’an ba Na’ayen yela. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Nirib baseba mi da tana ka ba banaahi ziit bura-kaaruŋ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ka lan da tɔ tet ba yi ba tar u paa Yezu sa’ani nirib mikir la zugu, ba da lak dose’eog ka Yezu be la mɔpil; dol niŋa sigih kaaruŋ la ni u souŋ la. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yezu da nyɛ ka baŋ niriba sera sakir la ka pana yel kaaruŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;N dawɔɔga, i nyɛ yelebe’et suguru dii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Pa’an pa’alib la seba n da zĩ niŋa la da tẽ’ẽh tulih tulih ba putẽra ni yet yii, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />&lt;&lt;La nan iŋa yela ka U tɔɣɔt ŋwala, U to’ora Na’ayene? Na’ayen ma’a n nan tɔ’ɔn di suguru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Nila nila ka Yezu baŋ U mɛŋ putẽ’ẽr poŋi niriba n tẽ’ẽhit se’em ka bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Nan n so ka ya tẽ’ẽhit putẽ ãã wa? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Lan n a naana, i yel kaaruŋ yii, i nyɛ i yelebe’et suguru bee i yel u yi dɔɔgum zaŋ i souŋ la keŋe?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Yela ka ya nan baŋ yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la tar kpe’eon-se’eog n nan tɔ’ɔn di yelebe’et suguru teŋa zugu.&gt;&gt; U da pana yel kaaruŋ la yii, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;N yet i mi wa, dɔɔgum zɛ’ɛl saazugu, ka zaŋ i souŋ la ni i kul.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Buraaga da dɔɔ mi yaɣabi nirib la tɔɔn vaa u souŋ keŋ yi; la da iŋ niriwoo la pakir ka ba pɛ̃ɣit Na’ayen ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;ti nan pu tabel nyɛ yel dee taaba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu bɔɔl Livai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yezu da le yi keŋ la mɔɣir la nkpeŋ ka nirib berigu da tã U sa’ani na ka U pa’an ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Un da ken la, U da nyɛ Livai n a Alefɛyɔs dawɔɔ la ka u zĩ lempodɛ’ɛrib tooma doog la ni, ka U yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Dol Mam na.&gt;&gt; Ka u da dɔɔ dolih U. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ka Un da zĩ ni nirib la dit Livai yir la, lempodɛ’ɛhirib ni yelebe’et dem berigu n da laɣum zĩ ni Yezu ni U nya’andolib la, nirikooŋ la n da dolih U la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ka pa’an pa’alib la n a Farasiinam la seba n da nyɛ Yezu ka U dit ni yelebe’et dem ni lempodɛ’ɛhirib la, ba da bɔ’ɔh U nya’andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Nan n so ka ya kpɛ’ɛm ma dit ka ŋwũũt ni lempodɛ’ɛhirib ni yelebe’et dema?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yezu N da wom ba n yel se’el la, U da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Seba n pu bẽ’ẽra pu ɛɛt teba daana, ka ba’anam n ɛɛt; Mam pu tana yi M bɔɔl la kassi dem ma, ka N tã la yelebe’et dem zugu na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔlor bɔ’ɔhug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Sankaŋ ma’a la, Farasiinam la ni Geon nya’andolib la da lo la nɔɔr; ka nirib baseba da tana bɔ’ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Nan n so ka Geon ni u nya’andolib la lo ba nɔɔr ka nyɛ ni I nya’andolib la pu loora?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Ka Yezu lebih bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Pɔɣɔsaaŋ n zĩ ka ba dɛ’ɛgu saan u zɔnam nan tɔ’ɔn lo nɔɔre? La a la daase’er ka u bɛk ma’a ka ba nan nyaŋ lo nɔɔr. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Dabiha kenna ka ba nan tar ser la keŋ ka ke ba, sankaŋ ka ba nan lo ba nɔɔr. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />So pu zaŋit fupaalug ligit fukorugo; so pu zaŋit tankot paɣɛn tanpaal zugu sɛ̃ɛ̃ra, tan kot la ããgir la nan yalig gaat yela. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Den zugu so pu zaŋit lenkorig suut dãpaalim, daam la nan tãh leŋ la; yela, la nar mi yi ba zaŋ lempaalig su dãpaalim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba bɔ’ɔh Na’ayen po’ohug daar la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Vo’ohug daar dikɔ̃ ka Yezu da dol U nya’andolib la ti yi poog ni, ka ba kom da dumit ka ba kɔ’ɔt ki la ɔbit. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Ka Farasiinam la yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Behimaa, nan n so ka I niriba gãlemit vo’ohug daar wara la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ka U lebih bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya nan pu tabel kããl kom n da wom Devit ni u nirib la ka ba iŋ se’em? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />U da kpɛ̃ la yendoog ni sanse’e ka Abiata a kããbug kpɛɛm la zaŋ yendoog kããbug teeb n a diit ka kããbug kpɛm ma’a nar yi u di la di, ka zaŋ baseba te u nirib.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yezu da le yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ba diŋ vo’ohug daar wara la nirisaal som zugu ka la ka la ba maal nirisaal la voohug daar zugo; <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />yela zugu Asaal Dawɔɔ la n a vo’ohug dabihir la daan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Burase’e nu’ug n kpi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yezu da leb kpɛ̃ yenpo’ohug dobil la ni, ka buraa so nu’ug n kpi mi zĩ ni. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Niriseba n da zĩ niŋa la, da behit nyaa U nan sak teb buraaga vo’ohug dabihira nii, ka ba dol niŋa nyɛ U taal. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ka U da yel bura nukpi’iuŋ daan la yii, &lt;&lt;gaarun tɔɔn na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ka U pana bɔ’ɔh niriba yii, &lt;&lt;La a somma yi i tom toonsoma bee toombe’et vo’ohug daara, ti fãã vom bee ti ko?&gt;&gt; Ka ba da sin digi digi. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yezu da beh ba kaa kaa ni sũũr, la da womit U mi ni niriba sũya n kãb paa zĩ’ĩ la, ka yel buraa la yii, &lt;&lt;Tɛ̃ɛ̃gum i nu’ug.&gt;&gt; Ka u da tɛ̃ɛ̃ ka u nu’u kpiirug la nyɛ tebuk. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Farasiinam la da yi mi kalam keŋ ti naa ni Hɛrɔdiya dem yi ba beh ba nan iŋ se’em ko’ Yezu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nirikooŋ be Mɔɣir la doon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yezu ni U nya’andolib la da yi sigi mɔɣir la ni ha, ka nirib berug berug zɛ’ɛl Galilii teŋ dol ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Ban da wom toonse’a ka U tom la, nirib n ka kãle da yi Geudiya, Geruzalɛm, Idumeya, teh n be Geɔdan mɔɣir la nya’aŋ ha ni Taya ni Sidon tana, <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Nirib babug la zugu, Yezu da yel U nya’andolib la, yi ba ɛ’ ããruŋ zɛ’ɛl yamma ka gur ka nirib la da ti mɛrig U wa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Un da teb nirib berug la n so, ka niriseba n tar bã’ãh la zeɣɛt yi ba nyaŋ paa si’ih U. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ka sibɛ’ɛh n da ni nyɛ U, ba da ni lu la nvãba ka kaahit yet yii: &lt;&lt;I a la Na’ayen Dawɔɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ka U da ni kpa’am ba yi ba da bah ka so baŋ Un a so’o.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu N lɔɔ nirib pii ni bayi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yezu da do zɔɔr zugu ha ka bɔɔl seba ka U bɔɔt, ka ba da dolih U do. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ka U da lɔɔ nir piiga ni bayi ka bɔɔl ba yi Apostaliinam, yi ba be ni U, ka U nan Tom ba ka ba yi tin tɔɔl yelesoma la, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ka tar kpe’eonse’eog n nan tɔ’ɔn kat sibɛ’ɛh. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Nya’andolib pii ni bayi la ka U da lɔɔ la aa, Simɔn (so ka U da leb sɛɣɛ yi Pita); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />ni Gemis n a Zebedii dawɔɔ ni Geon n a u yebig (so ka U te u wo’or yi Boanɛgis, ka la vɔ̃ɔ̃r a Satãharig Dawɔɔ); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />ni Andiru, Filip, Batolomeo, Matiew, Tɔmas ni Alefɛyɔs dawɔɔ Gemis ni Tadeyɔs, ni Simɔn n yi Keena na la, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ni Geudas Isekariyɔt, so n da dɔ̃r Yezu la.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 3:19">Yezu ni Beelezebul</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:19">Ka Yezu da kul; <verse eid="MRK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />ka nirib la da le laɣah zɔ’ɔ babug gilig kaa, ka ba kɔŋ ba di bon dita. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />U mabiih la n da ti wom la, ba da yi ba gu U mi, den zugo nirib la da yet yi, &lt;&lt;U putẽ’ẽr pu bee.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ka pa’an pa’alib seba n da zɛ’ɛl Geruzalɛm na la yet yii, &lt;&lt;Beelezebul sibɛ’ɛ la kpe’eoŋ ka Yezu tar, lan n so ka U yaŋ kat sibɛ’ɛh la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yezu da bɔɔl ba tã U sa’ani na, ka pana tar maɣaha yet ba yii, &lt;&lt;La nan iŋa yela ka Sibɛ’ɛ nyaŋ kar Sibɛ’ɛga? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Teŋ nirib n zab bɔɣih taaba bɔɣir bɔɣir teŋ kaŋ kun tɔ’ɔn zɛ’ɛl a teŋa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Yir nirib mi n yelih taaba, yiden mi kun tɔ’ɔn zɛ’ɛl a yire. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ka sibɛ’ɛ mi n dɔɔ zabir ni u mɛŋ ka yelihug kpɛ̃ ni, u kun tɔ’ɔn zɛ’ɛl le, ka u ba’ahug paa mi. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ka so kun tɔ’ɔn kpɛ̃ paŋ daan yir ti zu u laɣat ka pu lo u daan yiiga, la a la un lo u la, ka pana nan nyaŋ tar laɣat la yi yir la ni. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, nirisaal buuri woo nan nyɛ ba yelebe’et suguru, hali ni ba toombe’et la n zɔ’ɔ ni se’em mi; <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />ka so n tɔɣɔ zɛrig Vo’ohun Som Sii la, ɔŋ daan kun nyɛ u yelebe’et suguru, u nan zi u yelebe’et la saŋa n ka ba’ahugo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Ka ba da yet yii, &lt;&lt;U tar la sibɛ’ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu yir dem Vɛ̃kki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ka Yezu ma, ni U sɔ̃ɔ̃t tana; ba da zɛ la yeŋ ka tom so yi u bɔɔl U te ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Nirikooŋ n da zĩ kaa U, ka ba da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;I ma ni I sɔ̃ɔ̃t n zɛ’ yeŋ ka bɔ’ɔhit I yel.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ka Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ban n a Mam ma’ ni N sɔ̃ɔ̃re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ka Un da beh seba n da zĩ kaa U la U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yam seba n zĩ kaa Mam ma, n a Mam ma’ ni N sɔ̃ɔ̃t! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />So woo n tom Na’ayen n bɔɔt se’em la, ɔŋ n a Mam sɔ̃ɔ̃g bee ma’.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kpaat la Maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yezu da pĩ’ĩl pa’an Na’ayen yela ya’ah mɔɣir la nɔɔrin. Ka nirikooŋ da be ni, yela zugu la U da zĩ la ããruŋ ni kɔ’ɔm la niha, ka nirib la zɛ’ doon womihit. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />U da zaŋ la maɣaha ma’a pa’an ba Na’ayen yela wa, U da yel ba yii, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Womih mi! Kpaat n da yi’ yi u ti bor. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ka bomboora<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kpaarib da ni lobe ba bomboora mi, a aa bam bahit nangena se’em la. </char></note> la baseba lu sarɔɔg zugu, ka niih gɔ ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Baseba mi da lu la tah zugu zĩ’ĩ ka ntan pu zɔ’ɔge, bomboor ãã da bul kalam, ka ba nyaɣa da pu nyaŋ sige ntan n pu zɔ’ɔ la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ka wuntɛɛŋ da ŋmɛ ba ka ba kpi ba nyaɣa la n pu sigi la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Bomboora baseba mi da lu zĩse’e ka gɔ’ɔh be, ka gɔ’ɔh la da nyaɣɛ ba ka ba kɔŋ okir, ŋwala da bah ka ba pu nyaŋ wole. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Baseba da lu tansom ni, da kpik somma, ka wol pihitã-tã, pihi yoob-yoob seba wol kɔbig kɔbig.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ka U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi, ka seba n nan womih wom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɣaha la n pa’an se’el</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Un da be U ma’a la, niriseba n da be ni U la ni U nya’andolib pii ni bayi la, da bɔ’ɔh U maɣaha la gbin. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ka U da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam seba dɛ’ɛ Na’ayen yela la, ka seba n be yeŋ la bam den dola maɣaha; <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />se’el n so la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">&lt;bam nan behit, amaa ba kun nyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ba nan womihit ka ba kum bɔke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ka yela n bah ka ba kun ŋmɛrig leb Na’ayen sa’ani ka nyɛ ba suguru diiga.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yezu yel ba yii: &lt;&lt;Yam pu bɔk maɣahiraa? La nan iŋa yela ka ya bɔk maɣaha wa zã’ãga? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Kpaat la da bot la Na’ayen yela. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Niriseba ŋman ni bomboora seba n lu sɔr zugu la, ba nan wom Na’ayen yelehum la, nila nila ka sitaana tana dɛ’ɛ yelehum la ka ke ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bomboor seba n lu tah zugu ka pu nyaŋ sigi nyaɣa la, bam n a niriseba n nan dɛ’ɛ Na’ayen yelehum la ni popeelum kalam. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ka bam n ka nyaɣa la zugu, ba nan nyaŋ be la saŋa bɛ’ɛla wa, ka dauŋ bee yeletoot n ti paa ba yelesomir la zugu, ba ni lu mi kalam ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ka seba mi a aa bomboor seba ka ba bor gɔ’ɔh ni la; bãã a la seba n wom Yen yelehum la, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ka teŋa yeletoot zugu, ni mɔrum pã’ãhug, ni laɣat putẽ’ẽr ni tana pɛ̃’ɛ̃rig bah ka yelesoma la pu tar taɣalim tet baa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ka niriseba mi n a aa bomboor seba n lu tansom ni la: bam wom yelesomir la dɛ’ɛ di won wola: seba pihitã tã, seba pihiyoob yoob, seba mi kɔbig kɔbig.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kania ka pe’eog vugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yezu da bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ba ni tar kania kpɛ̃ na zaŋa pe’eog vugul, bee zɛ’ɛn garug leuŋ ni, ka la ka ba zaŋ sugin na kok zugo? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Se’el pu sɔɣɔ, ka kun nɛɛ peelum mii, bee la lil ka kun nɛɛ peelumi daase’ere, <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />So n tar toba nan wom, un womih ma!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Iŋ mi ki’i ni yan womit se’el, Nyɛ n makit se’em tet la, yela nɔɔ ka ba mi nan mak te i, ka berigu nan malegun pa’ah te i. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Lan a la seba n tar la, bam nan malegun dɛ’ɛ berigu pa’ah, ka seba n ka se’el la, hali ba nan dɛ’ɛ bɛ’ɛla wa la, ka ba tar la, ka bah ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Biiluh zɔ’ɔgir maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yezu da le yel yii, &lt;&lt;Na’ayen Na’am Yir la, a mi aa so n zaŋ nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biili lob teŋ sãii, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />u nan gbihit ka vo’ohit wuntɛɛŋ ni wo’oŋ, ka biili la nan bul ka zɔ’ɔgit, ka u pu mi lan a se’em. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Tengbauŋ la maan na ku mɛŋ, yiiga a la vãug la, taɣel nkãr, taɣel puut, ka wola pana ba’ah zã’ã daan. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ka wola la n pana ti bi’i u yit ti ni u so’o, den zugo, bunik saŋa paa ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biiluh maɣahir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />U da le yel yii, &lt;&lt;Ti nan zaŋa lan maɣah ni Na’ayen Na’am Yir la, bee maɣah-den ka ti nan zaŋ make? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />La a mi aa nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biiluh, ka un lu teŋ u pɔ’ɔ mi gaat biili zã’ã n dɔ teŋa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ka un bul yi na u nan iŋ tikãt gaat tiih berigu ni yilekãra ka saazugu niih woɣɛt ba teɣet u ma’ahum la ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɣaha Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />U da doliha maɣaha ni bah ka Na’ayen Yelesomir la paa ba, ka ba da nyaŋ wom. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />U da pu mak tɔɣɔ te ba ka maɣaha ka niŋa, ka U da ni pirik tɔɣum la gbin pa’al U nya’andolib la mi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu gɔ’ɔ sambekãt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Dabih den la, zaanɔɔr n da ma’agit la, Yezu da yel U nya’andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka ti yak yaɣadee ha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ba da bah nirikooŋ la niŋa ka zaŋ U ni ba ããruŋ la, se’eog ka U da poŋin gur la. Ããrina ba seba mi da be niŋa. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Sambekãt da pĩ’ĩl lobit mɔɣir la ni, ka kɔmi’ih da kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t ããruŋ la ni ka ku da bɔɔt yi ku sim. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yezu da dɔ la ããruŋ la mi nya’aŋ gbihit, ka ba da nɛɛ U ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’alaa, tin yɛ yi ti kpi wa pu pak nyɛɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />U da vaa dɔɔ tãh sambeok la ka yel mɔɣir la yii, &lt;&lt;Sambeogaa! A bããlam!&gt;&gt; Ka sambeok la da gɔ’ɔ, ka zĩ’ĩ woo da ma’a boririri. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Lan n so ka dabɛɛm tar ya? Ya pu tar sera sakiree?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ka ba zã’ã da ya’ nɔya won taaba ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃ɔ̃ wa a la ɔni, hali ka sambekãt la ni mɔɣir la nan U nɔɔre?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb buraa ka Sibɛ’ɛ dol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yezu ni U nya’andolib la da dola mɔɣir la bɔbir dikɔ̃ keŋ ti paa Gerasini teŋ la ni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ka Yezu n da yit ããruŋ ni na la, nila nila ka burase’e ka sibɛ’ɛ dol u da zɛ’ɛn wɔɔt zĩ’ĩgin yit na to’ohit Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Buraa la da be la wɔɔt la ni, ka so ka’ nan nyaŋ ba’ u ni banaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ba da ni ba’ la u nu’uh ni u nɔba, ka u kɛ̃h nu’uh bana la ka kɔ nɔba bana la mi buyabuya, ka soso da ka’ panse’e n nan nyaŋ u wa. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Wo’oŋ ni wuntɛɛŋ zã’ã u da ɛɛra wɔɔt la ni zɔya la zut kaahit ka ŋmat u mɛŋ ni kuga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Un da nyɛ Yezu ka u be zãã ha la, u da zo keŋ ti su’un u tɔɔn, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Ka tãh ni nkɔkpɛ’ɛmir yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu, Na’ayen se’er n ka taraan la Biiga, lan ka i tar yi I iŋ ni mam? Na’ayen som zugu, m belimit I mi yi I da namihum ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Lan zugu Yezu da poɣun yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Sibɛ’ɛga, yim buraaga ni na!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ka Yezu bɔ’ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;i wo’oree?&gt;&gt; Ka u lebih yii, &lt;&lt;M wo’or a la Tam (la vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la ti zɔ’ɔ mi), lan zugo, ti zɔ’ɔ mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ka pana belim Yezu zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ yi U da kar sibɛ’ɛh la yih teŋ la nii. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Kurikurinam berigu n da be zɔɔr la bɔba dit sankaŋ la: <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ka sibɛ’ɛh la belim Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Ke ka ti keŋ kpɛ̃ kurikurinam ma ni&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ka U sak ka sibɛ’ɛh la yi buraa la ni keŋ ti kpɛ̃ Kurikurinam la, ka ba zã’ã kãl n a aa tuha ayi la zo sigi mɔɣir la ni, ka kɔ’ɔm di ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Burase’eh n da gur Kurikurinam la da zo kpɛ̃ teŋ la ni ka tenkpemih la ti yel ba se’el n iŋ la. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ba da tã Yezu sa’ani na ka nyɛ burase’e ka kolekpãbɛ’ɛh dol la ka u zĩ niŋa, yɛ fut ka yam tɛɛ a somma, buraa se’e n da serin tar kolekpãkooŋ la, ka dabɛɛm da kpɛ̃ ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Niriseba n da be ni ka nyɛ laan iŋ buraa la ni Kurikurinam la da tũ se’el woo n iŋ la pa’al ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ba da belim Yezu yi U yim ba zĩ’ĩ la ni. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yezu n da kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t ããruŋ la ni se’em ma’a la, buraa la ka kolekpãbɛ’ɛh dol la da belim Yezu mi yi U bah ka u dol ni U keŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ka Yezu pu sake, ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Kulim ti tɔɣɔ pa’al i yiridem ni i zɔnam, Daan la, N zo i nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g, ka maal i ka i lebig a somma la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Buraa la da leb keŋ Dekapolis so’olum ni ti tɔɔn Yezu n iŋ som se’eb te ɔŋ la. La da iŋa pakir te seba woo n da wom yel la la.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bompuŋ n kpi ni Bompɔk n tar bã’ã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yezu n da yak ha ni ããruŋ la, nirikooŋ n da laɣah gilig U mɔɣir la nɔɔrin, <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ka buraa n da a yendobil kpɛɛm ka u wo’or bɔɔn Gayirus la tana nyɛ Yezu, lu U tɔɔn, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ka belimit taɣahit yet yii, &lt;&lt;m pɔɣɔwɔɔ n bẽ’ẽt yɛ’ kum, yela, kem na zaŋ i nu’ug paɣɛl ka zugu ka ka nyɛ nima’ahum tebuk ka vo’o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yezu da dol u keŋ. Nirikooŋ n da mikit dol U. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Bompɔɣɔse’e mi n da be niŋa bẽ’ẽt ka ziim kpa’ahit hali ka la paa wompii ni ayi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />U da nyɛ namihug zɔ’ɔ mi tebanam sa’ani, ka saɣam u laɣat zã’ã ka kpelim pu nyɛ tebugo, hali ka u bã’ã la kpelim pa’ahit. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Bompɔk la n da wom Yezu yel la u da tã U sa’ani na, ka nirib mik zɔ’ɔ berug ka u pɛ̃rig kaa Yezu nya’aŋ nyaŋ kalim U fuug. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ka tar sera sakir yi, &lt;&lt;mam n kalim U fuuga, n nan nyɛ n tebuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Un da kalim fuug la se’em ma’a la ka u ziim la kɛ̃ gɔ’ɔ, ka u baŋ yi u ningbiŋ bã’ã la bahiya ka u nyɛ nimma’ahum. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Nila nila ka Yezu baŋ yi paŋ yi U ningbina niŋa tom se’el, ka ŋmɛrig behit nirib la kaagit, ka bɔ’ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔn n kalim n fuuga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ka U nya’andolib la lebih yel yii &lt;&lt;Nyɛ N nyɛ niriba n zɔ’ɔ mikit se’em ma ka le bɔ’ɔhit yii, &lt;Ɔn n kalim I fuugoo?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ni yelam zã’ã Yezu da sin ka behit kaagit mi yi U baŋ so n tom di la. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Bompɔk la mɛŋ n poɣum mi se’el n iŋ u la da tana gbi’it ni dabɛɛm, lu Yezu tɔɔn ka tɔɣɔ u yelemɛŋir la zã’ã. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;M pɔɣɔwɔɔga, i sera sakir ituk n ke ka i nyɛ nimma’ahum. Kulim ni suma’ahum ka bã’ã la bahiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ɔŋ n da nan tɔɣɔt la, nirib da yi kpɛ’ɛm la yir na yel U yii, &lt;&lt;I pɔɣɔwɔɔ la kpi ya. Yela zugu, ti nan le ke ka pa’anpa’al la namih u mɛŋ tana ya’a ha?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yezu da wom ban yet se’el la ka da yel yendobil kpɛ’ɛm la yii, &lt;&lt;Da zot dabɛɛm, sakim sera ma’a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yezu da pu sak yi so dol U pa’ah Pita, Gemis ni Geon, so n a Gemis sɔ̃ɔ̃g la. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ban da paa yendobil kpɛ’ɛm la yir la, U da nyɛ nirikooŋ n laɣah vuut kaahit ka fabin. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ka Yezu N kpɛ̃ la, U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka ya kaahira? Bii la pu kpii, u gbihirin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ka ba la’ U. Ka U yel nirib la zã’ã yi ba yi yeŋ, ka dol ni bii la ba’ ni u ma’ ni U mɛŋ nya’andolib la kpɛ̃ bii la n dɔ zĩ’ĩ la. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />U da gĩ bii la nu’ug ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Tali ta kum&gt;&gt; la vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la, &lt;&lt;Bompumbilaa, dɔɔma!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Nila nila, ka bompuŋ la dɔɔ ken kaagit (u da a la wom piiga ni ayi). Ka la da a pakir tet nirib la. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yezu da yel ba yi ba da ke ka so so wom yel laa, ka ba tem bii la diit ka u di.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ba zaɣah Yezu Nazarɛt teŋ ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yezu da bah zĩkaŋ ka U nya’andolib la da dol ni U kul U mɛŋ teŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />La da a la vo’ohug daar, ka Yezu da kpɛ̃ po’ohug dobil la ni ti pĩ’ĩl pa’an, ka la iŋ pakir te seba woo n da wom Un pa’an se’em la. Ka bɔ’ɔhit taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Burakãã la wa nyɛ ŋwala zã’ã la ya? Ka iŋa yela nyɛ yamboo la wa? U iŋa yela mi toonnyalema wa ka tomit a wa! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />U ka la kampinta la, Mɛɛri biburibig ka u sɔ̃ɔ̃t a Gemis ni Geoses ni Geudas ni Simɔn, u tɔ̃ɔ̃h pu laɣam be ni ti kpelaa?&gt;&gt; Ka zaɣah U ni nsũnyiim. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;zĩ’ĩ woo, Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛhirib nyɛt na’ahi mi, ka ba mɛŋ teŋ-dem, ni ba mɛŋ nirib ni ba mɛŋ yiridem m pu na’ahit baa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />U da pu nyaŋ tom toonnyalema niŋa, ka bã’ãnam bɛ’ɛla wa ka U da zaŋ U nu’ug paɣɛl ba zut ka ba nyɛ nimma’ahum. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />La da iŋ pakir te Yezu ni nirib la n da pu tar sera sakir la.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yezu N da Tom nir pii ni bayi la yela la</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ka Yezu da keŋ tembibih se’eh n kpɛ la ti pa’an niŋa. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />U da bɔɔl U nya’andolib piiga ni bayi la ti sɛɣɛ ba bayi bayi tom, ka te ba kpe’eoŋ n nan nyaŋ kat sibɛ’ɛh. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />U da yel ba yi ba da tar diiga bee tapɔk bee ligiri bee se’el se’ela, tarin dɔya ma’a. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Pir mi taɣara ka yɛ fuug kukɔ̃ kukɔ̃ ma’a. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam paa tense’e ka nirib la dɛ’ɛ ya ba yir, been niŋa ka ti yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Zĩse’e woo ka nirib la pu dɛ’ɛ ya bee womih ya tɔɣum, yan yim ka kpa’ah ya nɔba ntan bah niŋa, lan ka ba nan baŋ yi ba pu iŋ somma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ka nya’andolib la da yi keŋ ti pa’an nirib la yi ba bah ba toombe’et. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ba da kat kolekpãbɛ’ɛh berigu yihit ka tar kpaam sɔ̃ɔ̃t bã’ãnam berigu ka ba nyɛt ba tebuk.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geon Baptis kum yela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Na’ab Hɛrɔd da wom yi Yezu yelesomir la da yerig tenkaŋ la zã’ã. Ka seba da yet yii, &lt;&lt;Geon Baptis n vo’o kum poŋi leb na; yela n so ka U nyaŋ tomit toonnyalema la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Seba da yet yii, &lt;&lt;U a la Ilaagɛ.&gt;&gt; Ka seba mi yet yii, &lt;&lt;U a la Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛh, a aa nɔdɛ’ɛh seba n da poɣum be daalimi ha la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Na’ab Hɛrɔd da wom ãã wa ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;U a la Geon, so ka mam da fik u zugu la, n le vo’o leb na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Hɛrɔd mɛŋ da tom buraah ka ba gbã’ã Geon bob u tar keŋ ti wo’, yit la Hɛrɔd n da di u bɛɛr Filip pɔɣɔ Hɛrɔdiyas la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Geon da yel Na’ab Hɛrɔd yii, &lt;&lt;la kih mi yi i di i sɔ̃ɔ̃g pɔɣa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Hɛrɔdiyas, Hɛrɔd bɛɛr pɔɣɔ la da zaŋa lan yaa Geon ka bɔɔt yi u ko’ u. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Hɛrɔd da zot Geon mi, lan zugo, u da mi yi Geon a la popɛɛl ni kassi daan, den zugu ka u da bah u bããlam ka pu ko’ u wa. Hɛrɔd da ni womihit Geon tɔɣum ka la daamit u mi. Ka ni yela mɛŋ zã’ã u da ni sin ka bɔɔt u tɔɣum la mi. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Fɔl n da naam dola Hɛrɔd dɔɣum daar ka u bɔɔl nanam ni soogɛ-kpɛ’ɛnam ni Galilii nirikãra na yi ba dɛ’ɛm ka di. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Niŋa ka Hɛrɔdiyas bibompuŋ tana wa’ wa’a n ke ka Hɛrɔd ni saam la sũya ma’a. Ka Na’ab la yel bompuŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;Yelim nyɛ sũũr n bɔɔt se’el ka n nan te i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Hali ka po’ nɔɔr te bompuŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;se’el woo ka i bɔɔt n nan te i hali ni lan poɣun a yi n porig n na’am so’olum ma nzemiri te i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ka bompuŋ la yi yeŋ bɔ’ɔh u ma’ yii, &lt;&lt;N nan yel yi bo?&gt;&gt; Ka u ma’ la lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Yelim yi i bɔɔra Geon Baptis zugu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ka bompuŋ la zo kpɛ̃ yel na’ab la yii, &lt;&lt;Mam bɔɔt yi i zaŋa Geon Baptis zugu iŋ laa ni te mam nan-nan na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ka na’ab la sũũr da sa’am zɔ’ɔ, ka un po’ nɔɔr saam tɔɔn la zugu u kun zaɣah bompuŋ la m bɔɔt se’el laa. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />U pana da tom soogɛ yi u keŋ tar Geon Baptis zugu na. Ka u keŋ ban wo’ u zĩ’ĩ la ti fik u zugu na. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ka u Zaŋ zugu la iŋ laa poŋin tar ti te bompuŋ la, ka u dɛ’ɛ ti te u ma’. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />U nya’andolib la n da wom di la ba da keŋ ti zaŋ u ningbiŋ la mi ti laa.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu diih nirib tuha anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Yezu nya’andolib la da leb U sa’ani na, ka yel U bam n tom toonse’a, ka pa’al nirib se’em. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi na ka ti keŋ zĩse’e n a suramm ka ya vo’oh bɛ’ɛla.&gt;&gt; Nirib n da ba’ ken ka lebit ka ba pu nyɛt saŋa nan vo’oh bee di diire. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ba da kpɛ̃ ããruŋ niŋa keŋ zĩse’e n a suramm. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Nirikooŋ da nyɛ ban yɛ’, ka baŋ ban a seba ka mi keŋ nɔba kalam kalam deŋ paa Yezu ni U nirib la yiiga. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ka Yezu n da paa sigi ããruŋ la ni ka nyɛ nirib la n zɔ’ɔ se’em la, nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g da gbã’ãgu, ba da ŋmani ni pihi n ka kemira, ka pana da pĩ’ĩl pa’an yela berigu. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />La da ŋwɔɔn ni ka U nya’andolib la tana yel U yii, &lt;&lt;kpela a la sɛ̃k, ka la mi ŋwɔɔn; <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />ke ka nirib la keŋ tempoŋi ni yɛse’a n be yamma la da dii di.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ka Yezu lebih ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yam mɛŋ te mi ba se’el ka ba di.&gt;&gt; Ka ba yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Ti yi ti nyɛ ligiri sidi-tuhir ni kɔbisinaahi la ya da’ dii ka la paa ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Ka U lebih bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam tar la boruboru bale? Ka ba keŋ ti beh ka leb na yel yii, &lt;&lt;Boruboru banu, ni zimi ayi m be.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ka Yezu yel U nya’andolib la yi ba ke ka nirib la zi’in mɔma’aha la zugu bɔɣir bɔɣir ka ba tɔ̃r ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Seba da zĩ la kɔbig kɔbig ka seba zĩ pihinu-nu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ka Yezu zaŋ boruboru la ni zimi la gɔrig beh Na’ayen zugu po’oh ka gbɛ̃’ɛ̃h te U nya’andolib la yi ba tɔ̃r nirib la, ka zaŋ zimi la mi gbɛ̃’ɛ̃h te ba zã’ã. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ka ba zã’ã di tɛɣɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ka U nya’andolib la vaa boruboru ni zinse’a ka ba di tɛɣɛ ka la kpelim la pɛ’ɛl pe’et piiga ni tiyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nirib seba n da di dii la kãl da a la buraah tuha anu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu da ken kɔ’ɔm la zugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Nila nɔɔ ka Yezu da ke ka U nya’andolib la kpɛ̃ ããruŋ yi ba yak mɔɣir keŋ Betsayida teŋ ka U mɛŋ kpelim yi U keeh nirib la. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Un keeh ba bah la U dɔ la zɔɔr zugu yi U po’oh Na’ayen. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Zaanɔɔr da ti ma’a ka ããruŋ la keŋ bela mɔɣir la ni ha ka Yezu ma’a n be doon. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />U da nyɛ ka sambekãt lobit berigu, ka U nya’andolib la pu tã gaat ããruŋ la somma, ka U dɔɔ zɛ’ ken kɔ’ɔm la zugu to’ohit ba beogin wo’oŋ wo’oŋ ka la nam pu nɛɛge. U daa bɔ’ɔt yi U lɔk mi gaat ba ha. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Amaa ban da nyɛ U ka U ken kɔ’ɔm la zugu la ba da tẽ’ẽh yi U a la kok, ka te kaahik suram suram; <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />ba zã’ã da nyɛ U, ka amaa dabɛɛm n da sãã ba. Ka U da iŋ kalam tɔɣɔ te ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;Iŋ mi sũkpɛ’ɛmir, ka la a la Mam, da zotin dabɛɛm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ka pana kpɛ̃ ããruŋ la paa ba ka sambeok la gɔ’ɔ kalam. La da a la pakir te ba lan zugu, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ba sũya n da digilim la zugu ka ba da pu bɔk boruboru toonnyalema la gbine.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb nirib Genesarɛt teŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ban da yak mɔɣir la, ba da paaga Genesaret teŋ ka lo ããruŋ la zɛ’ɛl. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ban da yi ããruŋ la ni na la nirib da baŋ Yezu mi kalam, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />ka zo kalam kalam kaa teŋ la zã’ã zi ba’anam ba sona zut tã ban baŋ Yezu n be zĩ’ĩ la na. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Un da ni keŋ zĩ’ĩ, tembibih bee tenkãra, samana ni, bee zĩ’ĩ woo ba zãhit ba’anam dɔ’ɔn na yela hali ni da’ah ni belemit Yezu yi U ya’an poɣun ke ka ba ba’anam la kalim U fuug nɔɔr, ka seba woo n da serin kalim U fuug nɔɔr la nyɛ ba nima’ahum.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yaanam malema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Farasiinam ni gban-mi’irib seba n yi Geruzalɛm na la pana laɣah mi gilig Yezu, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />ka nyɛ ka U nya’andolib la seba pu pɛɛ nu’uhe ka dit nudɛ̃ɣɛ̃t, <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Se’el n so la Farasiinam la ni Geudem zã’ã n pu pɛɛ nu’uh sommaa, ba kun dii, dola ba malema ituk, <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />ba mi pu dit se’el n yi da’agin na ka pu pɛɛge, ni malense’a berigu ka ba dol a, aa ŋmana ni laah ni kut-doɣot pɛɛgir.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Yela ka Farasiinam la ni gban-mi’irib la bɔ’ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka I nya’andolib la pu dol ti yaanam malema, ka dit ni nudɛ̃ɣɛ̃re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;La a la mɛɣɛla yi Azaaya da nyɛ ya ŋmɛlema dema ituga mi, ka da deŋ golih diŋ yii, Niribaa wa na’ahit Mam la ba nɔngbana ni, ka ba sũya poŋi zãã ni Mam mi; <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />ba po’ohug tet mam pu yit ba sũya ni naa, la a la se’el ka nirib pa’al ba ma’a.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Ya bah Na’ayen nɔɔr yelehum la mi, ka dola nirisaalib malema.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya nyɛ la sɔsomir zaɣah Na’ayen nɔɔr yelehum la ka tɛɛ sak dola ya mɛŋ malema! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moozis da yel ya yii, 'Na’ahum i ba’ ni i ma;’ ka so n to u ba’ bee u ma’, nan ba’ahun kpi.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ka yam yel yi so woo n yel u ba’ bee u ma’ yi, 'Mam n zaŋ soŋ-se’er te ya a la kor-ban’ (la vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la Na’ayen teeb) <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />yela i le ka sɔr yi i iŋ se’el te i ba’ bee i maa’ <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />yelam mɛŋ ka ya dola ya mɛŋ malema la, ka Na’ayen nɔɔr yelehum la a zaalim. Ya yela woo ituk a la ŋwala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yezu da le bɔɔl nirikooŋ la yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya zã’ã womih mi nim, ka baŋ di vɔ̃ɔ̃r: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />se’el n nan kpɛ̃ nirisaal poŋi kun iŋ ka u lebig dɛ̃ɣɛ̃t daan, ka laan yit nirisaal poŋin na la n ket ka u a dɛ̃ɣɛ̃t daan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Bah mi ka so n tar toba nan wom un womih. <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ka Un da bah nirikooŋ la ka kpɛ̃ yirin la, U nya’andolib la da bɔ’ɔh U maɣahir la vɔ̃ɔ̃r. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ka yam mi kɔŋ bɔkir mii? Yam pu mi yi se’el n zɛ’ɛn yeŋ kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t nir poŋi kun tɔ’ɔn gãlemu wa, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Lan pu kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t sũũrin la, ka a poorin la, ka dol gbin yit na laa?&gt;&gt; (Ka pana yel yi dii woo ka dɛ̃ko) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Laan zɛ’ɛn nirisaal poŋi yit na la n a gãluŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Lan zugo nirisaal sũũr poŋi ka tẽ’ẽh be’et n a aa yaalug tooma, naɣayigum, nirib koo, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Kamboh, n-nyigum, putoon, pã’ãhug, dɛ̃ɣɛ̃t, nintɛ̃rig, wosãɣauŋ, pa’al m mɛŋ ni geri-tooma. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Yelebetee la wa zã’ã zɛ’ɛna nirisaal poŋi yit na ka u gãlemit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bompɔk Sera Sakir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ka Yezu da yi niŋa keŋ Taya teŋ la ni. Paa kpɛ̃ yir niŋa ka pu bɔɔt yi nir baŋ yi U bee. Ka ba mi da sin ka baŋ <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />ka bumpɔɣɔse’e bibompuŋ ka sibɛ’ɛh da kpɛ̃ la n da deŋ wom Yezu yela ka tana ku’un U tɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Bompɔk la n da ka Geuu buuri, be Sarofonika teŋ la da soh Yezu yi U kar sibɛ’ɛh la yi’ih u bii la ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />U da lebih yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Ke ka biih la di yiiga, la ka somma yi ti zaŋ biih la diit te baahe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ka bompɔk la lebih Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Sera, Ndaana, hali baah la n be teebul pullin la dit biih la n dit ka se’el yaamit teŋ la mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ka U yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n lebih ŋwala la zugu, kema, ka sibɛ’ɛh la bah i bii la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Bompɔk la n da leb kul paa yir la, u da nyɛ ka u bii la dɔ ka sibɛ’ɛh la serin bah u.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb buraa n a gaauŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ka Yezu bah Taya teŋ ka dol yi Sidon, tɔ Dekapolis tehin leb paa Galilii mɔɣɔrin. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ka ba tar buraa n a gaauŋ na belim Yezu yi U zaŋ nu’ug paɣɛl ka zugu. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ka Yezu tar buraa la leb nkpeŋ, zaŋ U nubibih tom u toba ni ka tobih nantɔ̃ɔ̃t iŋ buraa la zelemir ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yezu pana da gɔrig beh saazug ha, si’im paa, paa ka yel buraa la yii, &lt;&lt;Ifata&gt;&gt; la vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la &lt;&lt;wo’oma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Nila nila ka buraa la toba wo’o, ka u zelemir la mi lak, ka u pĩ’ĩl tɔɣɔt somma somma. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ka Yezu kpa’am nirib la yi ba da zaŋ yela yel so’o. Ka Un kpa’am ba se’em la, ba maalin tɔɣɔrin gaat yela. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ka la da iŋ pakir paa te nirib, ka ba yet yii, &lt;&lt;U it se’el woo la somma; U bah ka tobekpera womit ka gaana mi tã tɔɣɔt.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu n da Diih Nirib Tuha Anaahi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Dabih aŋa la ka nirikooŋ da be ka se’el ka’ ka ba nan dii, ka Yezu da bɔɔl U nya’andolib la yel ba yii, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g sãã Mam paa niriba m be ni Mam dabiha atã ka se’el ka’ ka ba nan di wa. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Mam n bah ba yi ba kul ni kom ma baseba nan ti ligi sɔr, bam n yi katenzãya na la zugu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ka U nya’andolib la lebih yii, &lt;&lt;La nan iŋa yela ka so nyaŋ diih niribaa wa ni boruboru daɣataporiga niŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Ka U bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Boruboru bale ka ya tara?&gt;&gt; Ka ba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Bayopoi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />U da yel nirikooŋ la yi ba zi’inim teŋ, ka U da pana zaŋ boruboru bayopoi la po’oh Na’ayen ka gbɛ̃’ɛ̃h te U nya’andolib la ka yel ba yi ba tɔ̃r nirib la, ka ba da tɔ̃r nirikooŋ la. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ba mi da tar zimbibih bɛ’ɛla wa, ka Un da le po’oh Na’ayen bah ba zugu la, U da le zaŋ ba te U nya’andolib la yi ba tɔ̃r nirib la. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ba da dimi tɛɣɛ ba zã’ã, ka zɔ̃ra la n kpelim la, ba da vaa ba ka ba pɛ’ɛl pe’et tiyopoi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Nirib la da paa nirituha anaahi, ka U da pana bah ba yi ba kul, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ŋwala n da ba’ah la U da do ããruŋ zugu ni U nya’andolib la ka ba da keŋ Dalemanuta teŋ so’olum mi.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ban da Ɛɛt Dããluŋ la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Farasiinam la da tana gããt ni U, ka yet yii U diŋ dããluŋ n yit tensoŋ poŋi na makit ba. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ka U da iŋ sũ’ũ U sii poŋi ha ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;La iŋa yela ka zomaaŋ kããdem ɛɛt dããluŋo? Yelemɛŋir kam yet ya wa, zomaaŋ kããdem kun nyɛ dããluŋo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ka U da bah ba ka do ããruŋ la ya’ah yak kolik la yakin dee la ha.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasiinam la ni Hɛrɔd dãbin la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />U nya’andolib la da tam mi ka pu tar boruboru, ka ba da tar la boruboru nkɔ̃ ma’a ããruŋ la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ka U da kpa’am ba yii, &lt;&lt;Beh mi nii, mi’in Farasiinam dãbin la ni Hɛrɔd dãbin la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ba da yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Ti m pu tar boruboru la zugu ka U yet ŋwala wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ka Yezu N da pana baŋ se’el n it la, U da bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Lan n so ka ya tɔɣɔt yi boruboru ka’a? Yam kpelim pu bɔk bee lik-kee? Ya sũya ko’omii? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ya tar la nini ka kɔŋ yi ya nyɛt-taa? Ya tar la toba ka kɔŋ yi ya womiraa? Ya mi pu le tẽraa? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Mam n da gbɛ̃’ɛ̃h boruboru banu la te nirib tuha anu la, ya da pĩ’ĩh zɔ̃ra la pɛ’ɛl la pe’et ti le?&gt;&gt; Ka ba lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;pii ni tiyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />&lt;&lt;Ka boruboru bayopoi la te nirib tuha anaahi la, zɔ̃ra la da pi’ih pɛ’ɛl la pe’et ti le?&gt;&gt; Ka ba lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;tiyopoi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ka U lebih bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt; Ya kpelin nam pu bɔk-kee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb burafɔɔ Betesada teŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ba da tã Batesada na. Nirib baseba da tar burafɔɔ tã U sa’ani na ka ka belimit Yezu yi U zaŋ U nu’ug si’ih u. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />U da gĩ fɔɔga nu’ug tar u yi teŋ la poŋi nkpeŋ ha ka Un da iŋ U nantɔ̃ɔ̃t sɔ̃ u nini ka zaŋ U nu’uh paɣɛl u zugu ka bɔ’ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;I nyɛt se’el laa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ka buraa la gɔrig saazugu ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam nyɛ nirib ka ba a aa tiih n ken la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ka Yezu da le zaŋ U nu’uh paɣɛl u nini la zugu ya’ah; ka u da wol zĩĩ, ka u nini la da leb nyɛt, ka u da pana nyɛt se’el woo somma. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Ka Yezu da bah u yi u kul, ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Da le dolih nirib la sa’ani ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita pa’al Yezu n a so’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yezu ni U nya’andolib la da be la ken ni ti paa Kayisari teh n be Filipi teŋ la, ka ba sɔrum zugu ka U da bɔ’ɔh U nya’andolib mɛŋ yii, &lt;&lt;Nirib yet yi Mam a la ɔni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ka ba lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;Geon Baptis, ka seba yet yii, Ilaagɛ, ka seba kpelin yet yi, Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛhirib la nkɔ̃.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ka U bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ka yam yet yi N a la ɔni?&gt;&gt; Ka Pita lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ N a Fããt la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ka Yezu kpa’am ba yi ba da yel so so Ɔn n a so’o.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu tɔɣɔ U Kum ni Vo’ogum Dɔɔ yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ka U da pana pĩ’ĩl pa’an ba yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan nyɛ namihug n ka makire, ka kpɛɛnam la ni, malema kpɛɛnam la ni wara pa’alib la zaɣah Mam ka ko’ M ka dabiha atã daar N nan vo’o dɔɔ ya’ah. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />U da yel ba laa woo ka pu sɔɣɔ se’el se’el la. Ka Pita da tar U leb nkpeŋ ti yel U yii, dee wa kun tɔ’ɔn iŋe. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ka Yezu ŋmɛrig beh U nya’andolib la ka tãh Pita yet yii, &lt;&lt;Sitaana wa, lebum Mam nya’aŋ ha, i pu tar Na’ayen yela i putẽ’ẽr nii, ka i tẽ’ẽhira nirisaal yela.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yezu da bɔɔl U nya’andolib la ni nirikooŋ la mi ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Seba n bɔɔt yi ba a Mam nya’andolib nar yi ba zaɣah ba mɛh ka zi ba mpuur-dɔɔt dol Mam. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Seba n bɔɔt yi ba gu’ ba vom nan kɔŋ bu, ka seba n kɔŋ ba vom Mam zugu, ni Na’ayen yela la zugu nan gu’ bu. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ka ŋwɔteni ka ba nan nyɛ, bam n nyɛ teŋa laɣat zã’ã ka kɔŋ ba vom? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ba nan zaŋ la nan tɛk ba vom ma zugo? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Seba n zot vi ni Mam ni N yelehum ma be’em saŋa wa nirib tɔɔn, Asaal Dawɔɔ la mi nan zot vi ni badem U lebig daar ka U lebit na ni U Ba’ paŋ ni malekasoma la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu ningbiŋ tɛɛgir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;yelemɛŋir kam yet ya wa, ya seba zɛ kpela ka kun mak kpii see ka Na’ayen so’olum la n ti paa ya na ni paŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Dabiha ayoobi n da gaat la, Yezu da zaŋ Pita, Gemis ni Geon do zɔɔr zugu, ka ba be ba ma’a. Ka U ningbiŋ tɛɛ, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ka U laɣat lebig pɛɛlig ka so ka teŋa ni nan tɔ’ɔn tɛɛ dii. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ka ba da wol ka Ilaagɛ ni Moozis nɛɛ ba mɛŋ tɔɣɔt ni Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Ka Pita yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’ala, la a somma yi ti be kpela! Bahum ka ti tĩ soɣa te nyɛ, Moozis ni Ilaagɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pita da pu mi un nan yel se’ere, dabɛɛm n da sãã ba la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ka nila nɔɔ ka sangbauŋ tana pĩ ba. Ka nkɔr yit sangbauŋum ni na yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃ɔ̃ a la Mam Dawɔɔ, So ka N nɔŋ; Womih mi ni U!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Nila nila nɔɔ ka ba wol ka pu nyɛ so nii, ka Yezu ma’a.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilaagɛ kenna la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ban da pana zɛ’ɛl zɔɔr la zugu sigit na la, ka U yel ba yi ba da yel so se’el ka ba nyɛ laa, see ka Asaal Dawɔɔ la n ti vo’o U mɛŋ kum la poŋi. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ka ba serin pu yel so’o ka hali bɔ’ɔhit taaba vo’ogum kum poŋi dɔɔ la gbin. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ka ba da bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Nan ka pa’alib la yel yii Ilaagɛ nar yi u tã yiiga na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ilaagɛ serin nan tã yiiga na bah ka se’el woo leb zɛ’ɛl. La iŋa yela ka la golih yi Asaal Dawɔɔ nan tana nyɛ toog ni kɛɛra? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Amaa n yet ya yi Ilaagɛ poɣun tana, ka ba iŋ u bam m bɔɔt se’em, a aa lan poɣun golih se’em la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buribig n tar sibɛ’ɛ nyɛ tebuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ban da tã Yezu nya’andolib la sa’ani na la, ba nyɛ ka nirikooŋ kaa ba mum, ka pa’an pa’alib baseba gããt ni ba. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nirikooŋ la zã’ã n da nyɛ U la, dabɛɛm da kpɛ̃ ba mi, ka ba zo keŋ U sa’ani ti po’oh U. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />U da bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Nan zugu ka ya gããt ni ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nir nkɔ̃ da zɛ’ɛl nirikooŋ la poŋi lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’ala, Mam tara n dawɔɔ ka sibɛ’ɛh kpɛ̃ u ka u pu tã tɔɣɔra; <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />ka lan ti gbirig u la ni lob u la teŋ, ka u ɔbit u nyina ka natɔ̃pulimpuut yit, ka n yel I nya’andolib la yi ba sa’a sibɛ’ɛga ka ba yel yi ba kun nyaŋe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam seba sera sakir n pɔ’ɔga, saŋa yela ma’a ka Mam nan kpelim be ni ya? Lan zugu ka Mam kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t ni ya wa? Tarin u tã N sa’ani na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ka ba tar buribig la keŋ U sa’ani, sibɛ’ɛ la n nyɛ U la, ka da gbirig bii la mi ti bah teŋ ka natɔ̃pulimpuut yit na ka u bilimit. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yezu da bɔ’ɔh u ba’ la yii, &lt;&lt;Lan pĩ’ĩl it ŋwala wa la wuuga yela?&gt;&gt; Ka u lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Ba n kɔ’ɔm dɔɣɔ u biilimi na. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />La ni zaŋ u lob buɣum bee kɔ’ɔm poŋi yi la sãɣum u, ka Nyɛ n nan nyaŋ iŋ se’el, Nyɛ n zom ti nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g ka soŋ ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yezu da lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;La nan nyaŋ! Se’el woo nan tɔ’ɔn iŋ te seba n tar sera sakir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nila nila ka bii la ba’ kaah buki yel yii, &lt;&lt;N sak ya; soŋum ni m putẽtula wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ka Yezu N da nyɛ nirikooŋ la n zot kaagit la, U tãh sibɛ’ɛ la yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ sibɛ’ɛse’e n bah ka biiga a gaauŋa, yim ka sa’ani na, ka da le leb naa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ka sibɛ’ɛga da kaah suppi ka zɛ̃k bii la fãb teŋ, ka yi ka bah ka ka dɔ saali a aa u kpi mi la, ka nirib da serin tẽ’ẽh yi, &lt;&lt;u kpi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ka Yezu da gĩ u nu’ug darig dɔɔ saazug ka u zɛ’ɛl. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yezu N da kpɛ̃ yir la ni la U nya’andolib la da bɔ’ɔh U bããlam yii, &lt;&lt;Lan n so ka tam da pu nyaŋ kar sibɛ’ɛ la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yezu da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Po’ohug ma’a n nan tɔ’ɔn kar bãã wa taab.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu da le deŋ yel U Kum ni Vo’ogum Dɔɔ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ba da yi niŋa keŋ dol Galilii gaat. Ka U da pu bɔɔt yi so baŋe; <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />se’el n so la U da pa’an U nya’andolib la mi yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ba nan ti zaŋ Asaal Dawɔɔ la dɔ̃r te nirib ka ba ko’ U, amaa dabiha atã daar, U nan vo’o dɔɔ kum la poŋi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ka U nya’andolib la da pu bɔk se’el ka U yet la ka dabɛɛm mi tar ba yi ba bɔ’ɔh.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔn paŋ n gaat zã’ãga?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ba n da paa Kapanaum teŋ, pana ti be yir poŋi la, U da bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Lan ka ya gããrin sɔrin ha la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Amaa ba da pu lebihe, se’el n so la ba da gããt yi ba baŋa so n gaat zã’ã ba poŋi. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />U da zi’in teŋ ka bɔɔl ba pii ni bayi la na ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;So n bɔɔt yi u a ya tɔɔngat nar yi u a ntomit te ya zã’ã.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />U pana da ŋwɔk bibil zaŋ pa’ah ba zugu, ka le ŋwɔk ka U nu’uh ni ka yel ba yii, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;So n dɛ’ɛ bii ŋwala Mam wo’or zugu dɛ’ɛga Mam n la, ka so mi n dɛ’ɛ Mam dɛ’ɛga so n tom Mam na la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ka Geon yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’ala, ti nyɛ la so ka u kat sibɛ’ɛh ni I wo’or, ka ti zɛɣirin yi ti gu’ u, se’el n so la u pu pa’ah ti seba n dol I la poŋii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ka Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da gu’urin u, se’el n so la, so n iŋ se’el somma ni Mam wo’or kun ti tɔ’ɔn tɔɣɔ be’em gɛ̃ɛ̃h Mam. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />So n pu zaɣah Mam, be ni ti mi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ka Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, so n te ya kɔ’ɔm ni ŋman yi ya ŋwũ Mam wo’or zugu nan nyɛ u wɔɔt.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pã’ãhug yi i Tom Be’em</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Ya so n zaŋ ziir zi bombil so’ yi u dol Mam zugu, Ɔŋ daan ti nar mi yi ba zaŋ kugir lo yɛɛl u nangɔ̃ɔ̃r ka lob u bah mɔɣir poŋi ha. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />I nu’ug n bah ka i tomit be’em, ŋmaagum ku bah; la a somma yi i kpɛ̃ tensoŋ ni nu’ug kukɔ̃ gaat nyɛ n kpɛ̃ tenzẽ'ẽog buɣum poŋi ni nu’uh siyi, buɣun se’eb n dit ka pu mi kpiŋir la. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Zĩ’ĩ ka nzũse’a n dit ya la kun malegun kpii, ka buɣum la mi kun malegun kpiŋe. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ka i nɔbir n bah ka i tomit be’em ŋmaagum di bah, se’el n so la, la a somma yi i kpɛ̃ tensoŋ ni nɔbiyen gaat nyɛ n kpɛ̃ tenzẽ’ẽog ni nɔba ayi. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Zĩ’ĩ ka nzũse’a n dit ya la kun malegun kpii, ka buɣum la mi kun malegun kpiŋe. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ka i niuh n bah ka i tomit be’em, kpekum bu bah, la a somma yi i nyɛ Na’ayen tensoŋ so’olum la ni nin-yem gaat nyɛ n kpɛ̃ tenzẽ’ẽog buɣum la ni ni nini ayi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Zĩ’ĩ ka nzũse’a n dit ya la kun malegum kpii, ka buɣum la mi kun malegun kpiŋe. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Se’el n so la, nir woo nan ti sɛ̃ u mɛŋ ni yaarum buɣum. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Yaarum a somma, amaa bu mahum la n yi, bu nan iŋa yela nyaŋ ka mahum la leb na? Tarin yaarum ya tinsok ka be ni sũma’ahum ni taaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pɔɣɔ-lebihug Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yezu da bah niŋa ka keŋ Geudiya so’olum ti gaat Geɔdan mɔɣir la. Ka nirikooŋ da le gilig U ka U pa’an ba a aa Ɔŋ n poŋin ni it se’em la.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Farasiinam baseba da tana bɔɔt yi ba mak U beh, ka bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;La tar sɔr yi buraa lebih u pɔɣa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Moozis da te nɔɔr yi ya iŋ yeledee la yela?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ka ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;Moozis da te nɔɔr yi buraa tɔ’ɔn golih gbauŋ zaɣah bompɔk ka kar u.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;ya sũya la n kpɛ’ɛm la zugu ka u yel yi ya golih yela. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ka teŋ pĩ’ĩlug ni na, 'Na’ayen da maal ba la bompɔk ni buraa.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />'Ŋwala zugu, buraa nan bah u ba’ ni u ma’ ka naa ni u pɔɣɔ, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ka ba bayi la pana nan a ningbiŋ kakɔ̃.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Yela zugu niriseba ka Na’ayen zaŋ laɣum la so so da yelig baa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ba n da leb yirin la U nya’andolib la da le bɔ’ɔh U yeledee wa mi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Burase’e n lebih u pɔɣɔ ka tɛɛ di kakɔ̃ tom la kamboh, <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />ka bompɔɣɔse’e mi n zaɣah u ser ka leb ɛl, tom la kamboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kã Maal Bibibih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Nirib da tar bibibih ken Yezu sa’ani na yi U zaŋ U nu’ug paɣɛl ba zut; ka U nya’andolib la da sa’ahit ba. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ka Yezu N da nyɛ yela la, U poor da pu pɛɛge, ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka bibibih la tã N sa’ani na, ka da gu’urin baa; ka Na’ayen tensoŋ so’olum la a la bam den. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, so n pu dɛ’ɛ Na’ayen so’olum la a aa bibibih ha kun maalin kpɛ̃ ka nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />U pana da ŋwɔ̃ɣɔ ba U nu’uhin, ka kã maal ba.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bura Bontat la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yezu N da dɛ’ɛgit sɔr yi U keŋ la, buraa se’e da zo na dɔ̃bel U tɔɔn ka bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’an pa’al Soŋaa, n nan iŋa yela ka paa vonse’eb n ka ba’ahug la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Yela ka i bɔɔn Mam yi Pa’an pa’al soŋa? Nir pu be a sommaa, lan ka Na’ayen ma’a. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />I mi Na’ayen nɔdiŋa la: 'Da ko’ nira; Da tom kamboh tooma; Da zuu; Da maɣara; Da fã so’o; na’ahum i ba’ ni i ma.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ka u leb yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’alaa, mam it laa woo mi m biilimi na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yezu da wol u ki’i ni nɔŋir ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Bon nkɔ̃ ka i pu tara; kema, ni i ti kɔɔh se’el woo ka i tar, zaŋ ligiri la te tarenam, ka i nan tar laɣat tensoŋ yir; ka pana tana dol Mam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Un da wom ŋwala la, la da sãɣum u sũũr mi ka u keŋ kul, den zugo, u da a la bontat.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yezu da pana beh kaa kaa ka yel U nya’andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;La nan a kpɛ’ɛmiri tet bontatib yi ba kpɛ̃ Na’ayen Tensoŋ Na’am Yir la!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ka U nya’andolib la da ya’ nɔya won taaba yit yelese’a ka ba wom ma. Ka Yezu da le yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Biihaa, Na’ayen tensoŋ na’am yir la kpɛ̃’ɛ̃ kpɛ’ɛm mi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />La nan a naana tet wɔɣun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ba da mɛ la nangɔmir kaa Geruzalɛm mum ka vɔ̃ɔ̃r bɛ nangɔmir mɛŋ ni ka ba bɔɔn di yi fupĩĩm niuh.</char></note> yi u kpɛ̃ fupiim vɔ̃ɔ̃r, ni gaat bontat yi u kpɛ̃ Na’ayen tensoŋ na’am yir la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />La da iŋ ba la pakir ka ba ya’ nɔya ka yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Ŋwala wa, ka ɔn n pana nan nyɛ fããgire?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yezu da ŋmɛrig wol ba ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Di tɔ tet la saalib ka Na’ayen sa’ani la, a la pu tɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ka Pita da yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Behima, tam bah se’el woo mi ka dol nyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yezu da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, so pu bah u yir, bee bɛɛnam, bee yebih, bee tɔ̃ɔ̃h, bee ma’ bee ba’ bee biih bee samana Mam zugu ni Na’ayen yelesomir la zugu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ka kun nyɛ wɔ̃ɔ̃t dɔɣɔl paa kɔbig zina beoga, ka yɛ’, bɛɛnam ni yebih, tɔ̃ɔ̃h, manam ni biih, samana zaŋ namihug nan paa seba n ɛɛt vom n kumba’ah beog ha laa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ka seba berigu n gaat tɔɔn la nan ti leb nya’aŋ ka seba n be nya’aŋ la gaat tɔɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Tɔɣɔ U Kum ni Vo’ogum dɔɔ yela la pa’ah Butã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ba da be la sɔr la zugu, doot Geruzalɛm, ka Yezu da ken gaat ba tɔɔn ha; la da iŋa pakir te ba, ka dabɛɛm da sãã seba n dol la. U da le tar ba piiga ni bayi la leb nkpeŋ ti pĩ’ĩl yet ba se’el n nan iŋ U, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />yet yii, &lt;&lt;beh mi nii, ti yɛ’ doora Geruzalɛm ka ba nan zaŋ Asaal Dawɔɔ te malemadem kpɛ’ɛnam ni wara pa’alib la ka ba nan di U sariya ka zaŋ U te yi ba ko’; ba nan zaŋ U te Nivozaalih la; <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />ba nan kɛɛr U, ka tobih nantɔ̃ɔ̃t ma U, ka ŋmɛ U, ka ko’ U; ka dabiha atã daar U nan vo’o ya’ah.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gemis ni Geon Sohuk la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Gemis ni Geon n a Zebedii dawɔɔh la, da gaat na yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’ala, ti bɔɔt yi I iŋ se’el woo ka ti bɔ’ɔh I sa’ani te ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Ka U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;La a la nan ka ya bɔɔt yi N iŋ te ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ka ba yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Bahum ka ti zi’in, nkɔ̃ I dituŋ nu’ug, nkɔ̃ I gɔbig nu’ug, I Na’am la poŋi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya pu mi yan bɔ’ɔhit se’el laa. Ya nan ŋwũ ŋmanse’er ka Mam ŋwũraa, bee dɛ’ɛ sose’eb taab ka ba so Mam maa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ka ba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Ti nan nyaŋ.&gt;&gt; Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ŋmanse’er ka Mam ŋwũũt la ya nan tɔ’ɔn ŋwũ, ni sose’eb ka ba so Mam la ba nan tɔ’ɔn so yam mi; <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />amaa ya zi’in n dituŋ nu’ug bee n gɔbig nu’ug la, lan ka Maan nan te yaa, ka la a la seba zugu ka ba poɣin deŋ maahum diŋ la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ba nya’andolib pii la n da ti wom ŋwala la, ba da iŋa sũũr ni Gemis ni Geon. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ka Yezu da bɔɔl ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;Ya mi yi Nivozaaliha tinsok seba ka ba mi yi ba a la ba tɔɔngatib la pu beh nyɛt tarenam laa, kpɛ’ɛnam la mɛlihit tarenam la mi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ka la pu nar yi la a yela yam tinsoko, ka so woo n bɔɔt kpe’eoŋ yam tinsok nan lebig ya ntomit, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />ka so woo n bɔɔt yi u a ya tɔɔngat nan lebig ya zã’ã da’abir. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Asaal Dawɔɔ la pu tana yi ba tom te U wa, ka Ɔŋ tom te nirib, ka zaŋ U vom kããb te saalib berigu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batimaus n da a Fɔɔ la Tebuk la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ba da tã Geriko na. Ka Ɔŋ ni U nya’andolib la ni nirikooŋ n da bahit Geriko la, Batimaus n a fɔɔ ka a soh-soh ka mi a Timaus dawɔɔ la, da zĩ la sɔrin. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Un da wom yi la a la Yezu n yi Nazarɛt na la, u da pĩ’ĩl ãrigit nkɔr yet yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu, Devit dawɔɔga, zom nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Nirib berigu n da tãhit u yi u gɔ’ɔ u vuut la, ka u da malegun ãrig gaat yela, &lt;&lt;Devit Dawɔɔga, zom nimbɔ̃’ɔ̃g!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ka Yezu tɛk zɛ’ɛl ki’i ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Bɔɔl mi ni u ka u tana.&gt;&gt; Ka ba da bɔɔl fɔɔ la ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Dĩ’ĩhum sũũr, dɔɔ ma ka U yi i tana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ka u da lob u fugɔbig bah ka vadɔɔ kalam tã Yezu sa’ani na. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;I bɔɔt yi N iŋa lan te i?&gt;&gt; Ka Batimaus yel U yii, &lt;&lt;M Pa’ala, ke ka n nini wa wo’o ka n leb nyɛt.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yezu da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Kema, ka i sera sakir la te i tebuk.&gt;&gt; Nila nila ka u leb nyɛt ka laɣan dol U ken.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kpɛ̃ Geruzalɛm Na’am kpɛ̃’ɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yezu ni U nya’andolib la n da pɔ̃r Geruzalɛm, paagit Betefage ni Betani, n lɛm ni Olif zɔɔr la, U da tom U nya’andolib la bayi, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi kpɛ̃ teŋa n be ya tɔɔn ha wa, ka ya n kɔ’ɔn kpɛ̃ ba’ah ya nan nyɛ ka bombil ka so nan pu bã’ã ka; lo zɛ’, lorig mi ka tar na. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ka so’ n bɔ’ɔh ya yii, 'Ya it yela bo?’ ya n yel u yii, &lt;Daan la n bɔɔt, ka U nan tar ka leb kalam na.’ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ba da keŋ ya serin te nyɛ ka bombil lo zɛ’ lɛm ni koliŋ pal la nkpeŋ. Ka ba n da lorigit ka la, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />seba n da zɛ’ niŋa bɔba la da bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya it la nani, lorigit bombil la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ba da yel ba Yezu N yel se’em la, ka ba bah ka ba lorig keŋ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ka ba pana tar bombil la na te Yezu ka zaŋ ba fut paɣɛl ka zugu ka U bã’ã. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ka nirib berigu da yarih ba fut sɔr la zugu ka seba ããh kpãlinkpããt vããt yarih sɔrum zugu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ka seba n da gaat tɔɔn ha la ni seba n da dol U la zã’ã laɣum sakit yii, &lt;&lt;Hozaana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Zusondaan n a so n tã ti Daan wo’or la zugu na!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Zusoŋ n a ti yaab Devit na’am teŋ la n kenna la! Hozaana be tensoŋ na’am yir!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ka U pana da kpɛ̃ Geruzalɛm keŋ kpɛ̃ Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni; ka Un da beh kaa kaa nyɛ se’el woo la, la da ŋwɔɔn ni, ka U da yi keŋ Betani ni U nya’andolib pii ni bayi la.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Po’ Nɔɔr te Nkaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Beog n da kãã ka ba zɛ’ɛl Betani leb na la, Yezu kom n da dumit. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ka Un da gɔrig zugu nyɛ ka nkaŋ a vippi ni vããt la, U da paa tẽ’ẽh yi U nan nyɛ wola ka zugu. Ka Un da paa beh la wola da ka nii, vããt ma’a, la da ka mu’ut saŋa n laa. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />U da yel tii la yii, &lt;&lt;So kun maalin di nyɛ wa wol ya’aha.&gt;&gt; Ka U nya’andolib la da wom bu.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kar Nirib yih Na’ayen Po’ohug doog la ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ba da pana tã Geruzalɛm na. Ka Yezu da kpɛ̃ Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni kat seba n kɔɔhit la, ni seba n da’at la yihit niŋa, ka tẽbit teebula la ka ba da tar tɛɛhit ligiri la ni koɣih la ka ba da zĩ kɔɔhit nangbana lebihit zɛ’ɛn; <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />U mi da pu sakit ka so ziit se’el dol Na’ayen po’ohug doog la poŋi gat ta <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />U da pa’an yet yii, &lt;&lt;La pu golih dɔ yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">'Mam yir nan bɔɔna po’ohug yir tet teh waabii’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">Ka yam zaŋ di lebig naɣayifããrih yire.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ka malema kpɛɛnam ni gban-mi’irib la n da wom ŋwala la, ba da mɔ’ɔga nini ɛɛt ba n nan iŋ se’em ko’ U, ka dabɛɛm mi lee tar ba nirib la zã’ã n da dɛ’ɛ U pa’alug la. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ka zaanɔɔr n da ma’a la, Yezu ni U nya’andolib la da bah teŋ kaŋ mi ka keŋ.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkaŋ-Kpiirig la n Pa’an se’el yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Beogin ka ba da gat la, U nya’andolib la da nyɛ ka nkaŋ la ko’omi ŋmaa tin paa ka nyaɣa ni. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ka Pita tẽẽ ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’alaa, beh maa! Nkaŋ la ka I po nɔɔr te la kpi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Tarin sera sakir ni Na’ayen. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />N yet ya la yelemɛŋir, nyɛ n yel zɔɔra yi, 'dɔɔgum sigi mɔɣɔra ni ha,’ ka pu tar putẽra ayi ayii, ka mɔr sera sakir yi nyɛ n yel se’el la nan iŋ, la serin yi la iŋ mi. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Yela la N yet ya yii, Ya n soh se’el ya po’ohug poŋi sak mi sera yi ya poɣun nyɛ di mi, ka di nan a ya den. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />&lt;&lt;Sanse’e woo ka ya po’ohit, di mi suguru te so woo n gɛ̃ɛ̃h ya se’el, yela ka ya Ba’ M be tensoŋin la mi nan di suguru te ya ni ya yelebe’et la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ka ya m pu dit suguru te taabaa, ya Ba’ n be tensoŋi la mi kum malegun di suguru te yaa.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Bɔ’ɔh Yezu U Kpe’eoŋ la n yi Zĩ’ĩ na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yezu ni U nya’andolib la da le tã Geruzalɛm na. Ka Un da yɛ kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni la malema-kpɛɛnam ni gban-mi’irib la ni ba po’ohug doog kpɛɛnam la da tã U sa’ani na, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />ka bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Lan kpe’eoŋ ka nyɛ tar tomit yelenyalin ãã zã’ãga? I nyɛ I kpe’eoŋa la yaha tar tomit yel ãã la wa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Ka Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;N nam bɔ’ɔh ya bɔ’ɔhug kukɔ̃ ka ya lebihum ka M pana yel ya Mam kpe’eoŋ la n zɛ’ɛl zĩ’ĩ na. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Geon kɔ’ɔm soo la da zɛ’ɛl la saazugu na bee nirisaal maluŋo? Lebih mi nim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ba da leb ti gããt ni taaba yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ti n yel U yii, 'la zɛ’ɛl la saazugu na,’ U nan yel yii, &lt;La da iŋa yela ka ya pu dɛ’ɛ u nɔɔr la?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />&lt;&lt;Ka ti n yel yii, &lt;La a la nirisaal putẽ’ẽre’?&gt;&gt; Dabɛɛm da tar ba la nirikooŋ la zugu, se’el n so la nir woo da sak ya yii, Geon a la Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛhit yelemɛŋir. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Yela ka ba lebih Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Ba pu mi’i,&gt;&gt; Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam mi kun yel ya kpe’eonse’eog ka N tar tomit la n yi zĩ’ĩ naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Pogut-potɔɔlih maɣahir la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yezu pana da pĩ’ĩl tar maɣaha maɣahit tet nirib la yet yii, &lt;&lt;Buraa n da se u tiih poog, mɛ nangɔmir kaa ku ti mum, tũ daam kɔ̃k bɔk ku poŋi, mɛ yitoɣoma gɔhuk ku ni, zaŋ gu’ul pogutib, ka keŋ tense’e ha. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ka tiwola la pɔ̃hik saŋa n da paa la, u da tom u da’abir yi u keŋ pogutib la sa’ani ti dɛ’ɛ u tɔ̃t na te u. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ka pogutib la da gba’a da’abir la ŋmɛ, ka sa’ag u ka u leb nuzaalih. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ka u le tom da’abir dikɔ̃, ka ba gba’a ɔŋ mi ŋmɛ u zugu ka yaal u. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ka u le tom ba nkɔ̃, ka ba gĩ u kɔ’ɔn ŋmɛ ko’. Ba n iŋ da’abseba woo ka u tom la se’em a la, ba ŋmɛ baseba mi ka ko’ seba. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ka poog daan la kpelin tar nir nkɔ̃ n a u mɛŋ dawɔba’ar ka u nan tom. Ba’ahug zã’ã la u da tom u ka tẽ’ẽh yii, 'Ba nan na’ahu ɔŋ n a m mɛŋ dawɔɔ la zugu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Pogutib la n da nyɛ poog-daan dawɔɔ la n kenna la, ba da yel taaba yii, 'So n nan ti tɛɛ so poog la n kenna wa. Kemi na ka ti ko’ u ka laɣat la tɛɛ a tam den.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Yela ka ba da serin gba’agu ko, ka zaŋ u ningbiŋ la lob bah poog la yeŋ ha. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Poog-daan la pana nan iŋ la yela? U nan keŋ ti ko pogutib la ka zaŋ poog la tɛɛ te seba. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ya pu kããl gbauŋ la zĩse’e n yel yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">'Kugese’er ka mɛtib la zaɣah la, n tɛɛ a ɛ̃ɛ̃bir kugir;’<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Daan la toomir n da ŋwala, ka ti nyɛ ka di a yelepakir tet ti’?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ba n da baŋ yi U mak maɣahir la gɛ̃ɛ̃h la bam la, ba da bɔɔt yi ba gbã’ã U mi, ka dabɛɛm n da tar ba nirikooŋ la zugu. Ka ba da bah U ka keŋ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lempoo wɔɔ Bɔ’ɔhug yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ka ba tom Farasiinam ni Hɛrɔd kpɛ’ɛnam Yezu sa’ani na yi ba bɛ̃r U ni Un tɔɣɔt se’em la. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ka ba tana yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’alaa, ti mi yi Nyɛ a la yelemɛŋir daan, ka mi pu yelehit niriba, se’el n so la I pu gãhit niriba, ka I pa’an Na’ayen sɔr la dola yelemɛŋir. La tar sɔr yi ti wɔɔt lempoo tet Siiza bee ti da wɔɔt tet u? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ti wɔm bee ti da wɔɔra?&gt;&gt; Ka Yezu n da baŋ ba gɔ̃’ɔ̃hug tɔɣum la, U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yela ka ya makit Mam? Te mi nim laɣakɔ̃bir na ka M beh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ka ba tar laɣakɔ̃bir na, ka U bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔn zugu foto ni u wo’or n be ni wa?&gt;&gt; Ka ba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Na’ab Siiza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Zaŋ mi se’el n a na’ab la bon te u, ka zaŋ se’el mi n a Na’ayen bon te U.&gt;&gt; Ka U lebihug la iŋ ba pakir.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kum Vo’ogir poŋi Bɔ’ɔhug la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Sadusidem seba n pu sak yi nir n kpi u nan vo’o dɔɔ kum poŋi la, n da tã Yezu sa’ani na bɔ’ɔh U yii, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />&lt;&lt;Pa’alaa, Moozis da golih gbauŋ niŋa te ti yi 'buraagin kpi ka ke u pɔɣɔ ka ba mi ka biiga, u sɔ̃ɔ̃g tɔ’ɔn di bompɔk la dɔɣɔ biih te u.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Buraah siyopoi n a sɔ̃ɔ̃t n da be, ka kpɛɛm la di pɔɣɔ, ka ka pu dɔɣɛ ka u kpi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ka u yebese’e n dol u nya’aŋ la tɛɛ di pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la, mi kpi ka pu dɔɣɔ ni kaa, ka so n taɣel butã la mi iŋ yela. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Sɔ̃ɔ̃t tiyopoi la zã’ã da di bompɔk la mi, ka ba so da pu mak dɔɣɔ ni kaa. Ka la ti paa sanse’e ka bompɔk la mi kpi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Kum vo’ogir daar la n ti paa, ba ɔn n nan so bompɔk la? Se’el n so la ba zã’ã da di ka mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ka Yezu da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;La ka ŋwala n pa’al yi ya tuu mi ka pu mi Na’ayen toolum gbauŋ la bee Na’ayen paŋa? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Se’el n so la, nirib n ti vo’o ba kum poŋi, pɔɣɔdir bee ser ɛl kun ti bee, ba ti a mi aa Na’ayen Malekanam m be saazugu ha se’em la. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />La n le a la kum vo’ogir la yela, ya pu kããl se’el n be Moozis gbauŋ la ni, dol mɔɔg la n da taa buɣum la. Na’ayen da yel Moozis yii, &lt;Mam a la Ebraham Na’ayen, Aizik Na’ayen ni Gekɔb Na’ayen.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Na’ayen a la seba n vo’ Na’ayen ka ka seba n kpi Na’ayene, Ya ba’ tuu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiiga Na’ayen Nɔdiŋir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Gban-mi’irib la poŋi nkɔ̃ n da vurih lɛm na ka wom ka ba ŋmɛ’ɛt nɔkpɛ’ɛmir ni taaba, ka un da baŋ yi lebihug la ka Yezu da lebih la a somma la, u da le bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Na’ayen nɔya la poŋi, di den n a yiiga bee gaat ba zã’ãga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Ka Yezu lebih yel yii, &lt;&lt;Nɔse’er n gaat zã’ã a la, 'Womih mi somma, Izirɛal dem maa: Daan la n a ti Na’ayen la, a la nkɔ̃la; <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Nɔŋim i Daan Na’ayen la ni i sũũr zã’ã, ni i sii zã’ã, ni i putẽ’ẽr zã’ã, ni i paŋ zã’ã!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Se’el n taɣel buyi a la, 'I nɔŋ i taraan a aa nyɛ n nɔŋ i mɛŋ se’em la.’ Nɔdiŋir pu le be gaat ãã la waa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ka gban-mi’irib la yel U yii, &lt;&lt;I tar yelemɛŋir, Pa’alaa; I yel yelemɛŋir yi Na’ayen a la nkɔ̃ la, ka la n ka Ɔŋaa so pu le bee’; <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />ka 'i mi nɔŋ U ni i sũũr zã’ã, ni i baŋir zã’ã, ni i paŋ zã’ã ka nɔŋ i taraan a aa nyɛ n nɔŋ i mɛŋ se’em la, ŋwala a somma gaat nyɛ n koot dun-muma kããbit Na’ayen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yezu n wom ka buraa la lebih tɔɣum la ni yam se’em la, U yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ pu zãã ni Na’ayen na’am yir laa.&gt;&gt; Niŋa nya’aŋ nir da pu le sak bɔ’ɔh U se’el la.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devit Dawɔɔ bɔ’ɔhug la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yezu N da be Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni pa’an la, U da bɔ’ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;La nan iŋa yela ka gban-mi’irib la yet yi Fããt la a la Devit dawɔɔga? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Devit mɛŋ, dol Vo’ohun Som poŋi da yel yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;Daan la da yel mam Daan yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;&lt;Zi’inim Mam dituŋ nu’ug bɔba wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">gur Ma n ti bah ka i dindem dɔ i nɔba ni.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Devit mɛŋ bɔɔn U la Daan; ka la nan iŋa yela ka u a U dawɔɔga?&gt;&gt; Ka nirikooŋ la da womihit U ni popeelum.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu kpa’am nirib yit gban-mi’irib la yela ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Un da be ni pa’an la, U da yet ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mi’in gban-mi’iriba yel, seba n nɔŋ yi ba yeet fukãra ɛɛt kaagit, ka nirib po’ohit ka na’ahit da’ah poŋi wa, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Ka mi nɔŋ ba zĩ tɔɔn kogih zugu po'ohug dot la ni, ni nirizuya zi’inug zĩ’ĩ dɛ’ɛn-kãra zĩ’ĩh. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ba fããra pɔkɔ̃ya laɣat ka po’ohit po’oh-wɔɣa yi nirib nyɛ ba. Ba nan nyɛ sã’ãhese’eog n ka makire.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la Yendoog teeb la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yezu da zĩ mi tɔ teeb pe'eog la n zɛ zĩ’ĩ la yendoog la ni, ka behit nirikooŋ la n tar ligiri ken it ku poŋin la. Bontatib zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ da tar ligiri berug berug ken it pe'eog la ni. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ka U da nyɛ ka pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r n a nɔŋ-daan paa niŋa zaŋ u laɣakɔ̃ba ayi n nan zem ni sidi nkɔ̃ iŋ niŋa. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ka U pana bɔɔl U nya’andolib la yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃ra n a nɔŋ-daana n te gaat seba woo n tar ba teeb na iŋ pe'eoga ni wa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Se’el n so la, ba zã’ã yiha se’el bɛ’ɛla ba ligikãra la poŋi tar na te, ka bompɔk ka ni ka nɔŋ la zã’ã, te la se’el ka ka tar, ka te la se’el zã’ã ka ka naan dolihin ni di la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Na’ayen Po’ohug doog la Saɣuŋ yela Deŋ yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yezu n da zɛ’ɛl Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni yit na la, U nya’andolib la nkɔ̃ da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Behimaa, Pa’ala, lan kugekãra ni mɛkãra n ŋwala!&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Ka Yezu bɔ’ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;i nyɛ mɛkãra waa? Kugese’a ka ba zaŋ mɛ la ni dikɔ̃ mi kun ti paɣɛl ditaraan zugo, a zã’ã nan ti gbirig dɔ’ teŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ɔŋ n da zĩ Olif zɔɔr la zugu Na’ayen po’ohug doog la yakin la, Pita, Gemis, Geon ni Andiru da bɔ’ɔh U ŋmɛɣe ŋmɛɣe yii, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />&lt;&lt;Yelim ti, sankan ma’a ka ŋwala wa nan iŋe, ka dããl koni n nan ti yi na pa’an yi ŋwala wa be ni yi la iŋ mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ka Yezu pĩ’ĩl yet ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mi’in ka da bahin ka so pã’ãh ya ka ya tuuge. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Nirib berigu nan tana Mam wo’or zugu yet yii, &lt;Mam a la Yezu!&gt; Ba nan pã’ãh nirib zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ ka ba tuu. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Yan ti wom zaba tehin ni zaba vulinvugit, da bahin ka ya yam ŋma’ara, ka laa wa a la se’el n nan ba’ahin iŋ, ka ba’ahug la saŋa nan pu paage. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Teh nan ti dɔɔ zaba ni teh, yizut nan ti dɔɔ zaba ni yizut, teh zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ nan ti miim, kom nan ti lu ka makir ka’a. Ŋwala wa nan a la yeletoot la pĩ’ĩlug saŋa.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sããhug Yela Deŋ yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Mi’in yi yam mɛŋ la, ba nan zaŋ ya te kpɛ’ɛnam, ka ba bo’ ya Geunam po’ohug dobibih la poŋi; ya nan ti zɛ gɔmenanam ni nakãra tɔɔn yi ba gãk ya Mam zugu, ka la a maan tet ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />La a la pɛ̃rigir yi Na’ayen yela la nan paa teh zã’ã yiiga. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ba n ti tar ya tã gãkir na, da fabin ni bam n nan bɔ’ɔh ya ka ya tɔɣɔ se’em, amaa yel mi la yelehun se’eb ka ya dɛ’ɛ sankaŋa ma’a la, den zugu, la ka la yam n nan tɔɣɔra, ka la a la Vo’ohun Som Sii la n tɔɣɔt. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Sɔ̃ɔ̃g nan dɔ̃r sɔ̃ɔ̃g ka ba ko’ u, ka ba’ nan dɔ̃r bii, biih nan dɔɔ gbiriri ni ba dɔɣɛrib hali ka ba ti ko’ ba; <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />ba zã’ã nan yaa ya Mam wo’or zugu. Amaa so n ti yaŋ ŋmib dol paa di ba’ahug nan nyɛ fããgir.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonkihug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ya n ti nyɛ ka bonkihug zɛ zĩse’e n pu narin yi la bee (ya seba n kaan la bɔk ma), seba woo n be Geudiya teŋ la zom do zɔya zut. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />So n yaɣa gɔhuk zugu da sigi yi u zaŋ se’el bee u kpɛ̃ doogin; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />ka so n be poogin da leb kul yirin yi u zaŋ u fuugo. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Sabaab nan ti paa pɔɣɛpoohedem ni bompɔɣɔse’eh n tar biih ka ba mɔɣɛt dabih aŋ poŋi. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Po’oh mi yi yel ãã wa da ti it sapalug saŋa. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ka dabih ãã wa ni, namihekãt se’eog n nan ti paa nirib la nan a se’eog n nan pu tabel iŋe, hali zaŋit Na’ayen N da naam teŋa pĩ’ĩlug saŋa na la ti paa zina, ku taab kun le malegun iŋ ya’aha. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ka Daan la n da pu ŋmaagin dabih aŋ bahin nii, so kun pɛ̃ɛ̃gin nii; la mi a la seba ka U lɔɔ la zugo, ka U sirig dabiha la bah. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ka so n ti yel i sankaŋ la yii, &lt;Behimaa, Fããt la n ŋwala!&gt; bee &lt;Behimaa, Un la ha!&gt; da sakin yi la a seraa. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Den zugo, niriseba nan ti tana maɣat yi bam a la Krista la bee Na’ayen nɔdɛ’ɛhirib la, ba nan yi na tomit toonnyalema ka yet yela berigu yi ba pã’ãh ya ka ya tuu, hali ni seba ka U poɣun lɔɔ la. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mi’in ka gur; Mam poɣun yel ya se’el woo.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaal Dawɔɔ la Lebig na yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ka dabih aŋ poŋi, namihug dabiha la n ti gaat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">wuntɛɛŋ nan sob</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">ka ŋmarik kun nɛɛgira,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />ka ŋmarebibih zɛ’ɛl saazugu lut na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">ka saazugu ni u paŋ la zã’ã miimit.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Niŋa ka ba pana nan nyɛ 'Asaal Dawɔɔ la ka U dol sangbana kenna ni pankãt ni pɛ̃k. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />U nan ti pana tom U malekanam ka ba dolih teŋa loɣa anaahi la zã’ã laɣah seba woo ka Na’ayen lɔɔ teŋa ni saazugu la.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkaŋ maɣahir la n pa’an se’el</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Zamih mi yam ka su'un beh nkaŋ maɣahira ni: ka nkaŋ yila n ti buhit vamɛla ya mi yi sigir lɛm mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Yela mɛŋ nɔɔ, ya n ti nyɛ ka yel ãã wa it yam baŋim yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la lebig na la lɛm mi, hali ka la kun wuuge. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />N yet ya la yelemɛŋir yi, zomaaŋ kãã kun ba’ahe lan ka la ŋwala wa woo ti iŋ gaat mii. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Saazugu ni teŋ nan ba’ah, ka Mam yelehum ma kun maan ba’ahe.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">So pu mi Dabihir bee Saŋa laa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Amaa so pu mi di daar bee saŋa laa, hali malekanam la n be saazugu ha la bee Dawɔɔ la zã’ã pu mi’i, la n ka Ba’ la ma’a. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Beh mi ka maahemit ka ya pu mi’ se’em ma’a ka la nan tanaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />La a aa buraa n yɛ kateŋ ka zaŋ u yir gu’ul u da’aba ka tɔ̃r ba ba tooma ba tooma, ka yel u zanɔgut la yi u behum ka gur u lebig na. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Yela la ya mi’ ka gur behit fassi, se’el n so la, ya pu mi’ se’em ma’a ka yidaan la nan leb naa. U tɔ’ɔn leb zaanɔɔr na, bee wo’ontasoo, bee beogin wo’oŋ wo’oŋ bee be-nkãhug. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ɔŋ n ti di’i leb na, la som yi u da nyɛ ya ka ya gbihira; <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />se’el ka Mam yet ya wa N yeta nir woo: &lt;Behimi!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ba sɔ̃ Yezu kpaam Betani teŋ ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />La da kpelima dabiha ayi ni ba di Azɔɔgaat ni boruboru kãha malema la. Ka malemadem kpɛɛnam la ni gban-mi’irib la da ɛɛt sɔrɔse’et ka ba nan tɔ’ɔn dolih gbã’a Yezu ko’ bããlam; <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />ba da yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Ti kun nyaŋ iŋ ŋwala wa dɛ’ɛma la niŋaa, ti n iŋ yela nirib la nan gberig zabir ni ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yezu da be la Simɔn so ningbiŋ n sa’am la yir Betani teŋ poŋi, ba n da be ni dit la, bompɔk kakɔ̃ da kpɛ̃ na tar doɣobil ni kpaam n tar wũsoŋ ka bu ligiri pu tã kãã na, pana vuk doɣobila, zaŋ kpaam la kpa’a sɔ̃ Yezu zugu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ka se’eba n da be niŋa la da bɔ’ɔhit taaba ni sũũr yet yii, &lt;&lt;lan n so ka u kpa’a kpaam ma da’a n tɔ se’ema bah ŋwala? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ba tɔ’ɔn kɔɔhin bu, bu ligiri mi tɔ’ɔn gaarin a aa sidi tuha atã, u mi tɔ’ɔn zãŋe ligi-ãã wa te tarenam.&gt;&gt; Ba pana da ŋwɔmit bompɔka mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;bah mi ka bããlam, ya daamit ka bo? U toma toonsomir te Mam. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Tarenam be ni ya mi saŋa woo, ka ya nan tɔ’ɔn soŋ ba yam m bɔɔt se’em ma’a, ka Man kun be ni ya saŋa woo. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />U iŋa se’el ka u paŋ tɔ̃’; deŋ kpa’a kpaam sɔ̃ɔ̃h Man ningbiŋ gur ka laagir. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mam yet ya la yelemɛŋir yii, tengbauŋa zĩ’ĩ woo ka ba tɔɔn Na’ayen yela la, ba nan zaŋ se’el ka bompɔka iŋa tɔɣɔ ka nirib tẽr u yel.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geudas Sak yi u nan Dɔ̃r Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ka Geudas Isekariyɔt so n da a Yezu nya’andolib pii ni bayi la nkɔ̃ la, da keŋ malema kpɛɛnam la sa’ani yel yi u nan dɔ̃r Yezu te ba. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ba n da wom ŋwala la ba poo da pɛɛ mi, ka ba da pana po’ yi ba nan te u ligiri. Niŋa ka Geudas da pana ɛɛt sɔse’er ka u nan dolih dɔ̃r Yezu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya’andolib la ni Zɔɔgaat Malema la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Zɔɔgaat malema la ka ba dit boruboru kãha ka koot pebibih dabihir la n da paa la, Yezu nya’andolib la da bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Yaha ka I bɔɔt yi ti keŋ ti maahum ka I di zɔɔgaat diiga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ka Yezu tom U nya’andolib bayi, ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;kemi kpɛ̃ tempoŋi ha ka ya nan to’oh buraa ka u ziit kɔ’ɔm ni woor, dolin u, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />ka un kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t zĩ’ĩ la, kpɛmi niŋa ti yel yir la daan yii, 'Pa’al la bɔ’ɔh nyaa dokoni ka i lɔɔ yi U ni U nya’andolib la di zɔɔgaat dii la?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />U nan pa’al ya dokãt n a dotoɣuma be saazugu ha ka se’el woo be ku ni, niŋa ka ya nam maahum se’el woo ka gur ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ka U nya’andolib la bah niŋa ka keŋ kpɛ̃ teŋ la poŋi ha serin ti nyɛ se’el woo ka U yel ba la, ka pana maahum zĩ’ĩ la a aa Ɔŋ n pa’al se’em la. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Zaanɔɔr n da paa la, Yezu ni U nya’andolib pii ni bayi la da keŋ yir la niŋa. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ka bam pana da zĩ dit la, Yezu da yel yii, &lt;&lt;N yet ya la yelemɛŋir yi ya seba n dit nim ma nkɔ̃ nan dɔ̃r Mam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ka la da daam ba ka ba nkɔ̃ nkɔ̃ bɔ’ɔhit U yet yii, &lt;&lt;A laa, la a la mam bee?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ka Yezu da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;La a la yam pii ni bayi wa nkɔ̃, so n laɣun dit ni Mam layeŋ ni wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan kpi a aa la m poɣun deŋ golih se’em la, ka sabaab nan paa so n nan dɔ̃r Mam la! Hali ba n da pu dɔɣɛn ni u wa, la sɔ’ɔɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daan la Niŋ ni U Ziim Dii la Pĩ’ĩlug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ba n da be niŋa dit la, ka Yezu zaŋ boruboru te Na’ayen tooma ka gbɛ̃’ɛh te ba ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;dɛ’ɛ mi, ka Mam ningbiŋ n la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ka da le zaŋ ŋman ni daam te Na’ayen tooma ka zaŋ te ba ka ba woo ŋwũ. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam nɔdiŋir ziim la n ŋwala, zĩse’eb ka ba kpa’a te nirikooŋ la. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, Mam kun le maan ŋwũ dãboo wa ya’aha, la n ka daase’er ka N nan ŋwũ dãpaalim Na’ayen na’am yir la poŋii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Zi’ihug la Deŋ Yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ba n da ba’ah la, ba da woom wooma ka yi keŋ do’ Olif zɔɔr la zugu. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Ka Yezu da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya zã’ã nan zo ka bah Mam, lan zugo, la poɣun deŋ golih dɔ yii, 'N nan ko’ dunkeen la ka pihi la zo’ yerig.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ka Man ti vo’o dɔɔ, N nan deŋ ya tɔɔn keŋ Galilii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Ka Pita yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Hali ba zã’ã n ti zo’ ka bah I, mam Pita kun bah I ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Ka Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir ka N yet i, zina wa, wo’oŋ koo nɔɔ i nan zi’ih Mam suɣum butã ka nɔrɔɔg nyaan kaah buyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ka Pita le yel pa’ah yii, &lt;&lt;La m poŋin a la man naa ni I kpi n kun malegun zi’i I ya.&gt;&gt; Ka ba zã’ã laɣun naa yela nɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Po’oh Gesemane Poŋi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ba da keŋ paa la tense’e n bɔɔn Gesemane la; ka Yezu yel U nya’andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;zi’in mi kpela ka N keŋ ti po’oh Na’ayen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />U da bɔɔl Pita, ni Gemis ni Geon pa’ah U mɛŋ zugu. Ka ba n da keŋ bɛ’ɛla ha la U sũũr da sãɣum mi hali ka U gĩĩla kɔ’ɔh. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ka U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;N sũũr n sãɣum zɔ’ɔ galih hali ka la a aa Man yi N kpi mi la, zi’in mi kpela ka gur.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ka U keŋ tɔɔn bɛ’ɛla ha ka lu teŋ po’ohit Na’ayen yi la n nan tɔ’ɔn iŋ, Un zaŋ daan-koo wa U sa’ani bah. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Aa, Mbaa, Nyɛ tɔ’ɔn iŋ se’el woo; yihim namih koo wa N sa’ani bah; ka bahum ka la iŋ a aa Nyɛ Mɛŋ N bɔɔt se’em la, ka la ka Mam N bɔɔt se’em.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ɔŋ n da leb na la, U da nyɛ yi ba gbihiri ka U yel Pita yii, &lt;&lt;Simɔnee, nyɛ gbihirii? Yam kun tɔ’ɔn pɛɣɛ behit bɛ’ɛla wa? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Behimi ka sohum Na’ayen yi be’em sããhug saŋa da paa yaa; ka ya sii la bɔɔt, ka taruk m paa ningbiŋ la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />U da le leb po’ohit a aa Ɔŋ n poɣun soherin Na’ayen se’em la nɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ka Un da le leb na la, U da nyɛ ka ba le gbihit, se’el n so la gɔɔm n da ba’ tar ba; ka ba da pu mi bam n nan yel U se’ere. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ka Un da le keŋ ka le leb suɣum butã poŋi la, U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya kpelin gbihiri ka vo’ohiraa? La sɛk ya! Saŋa la paa ya, ba dɔ̃r Asaal Dawɔɔ la zaŋ U iŋ yelebe’etdem nu’uhin. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Dɔɔ mi ka ti keŋ. Beh mi nii, so n nam dɔ̃r Mam la paa na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu dɔ̃rig ni U gbã’ãgir la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Nila nila, ka Geudas so n da a U nya’andolib pii ni bayi la nkɔ̃ la, paa na, ka Yezu nan poɣum pu tɔɣɔ ba’ahe, ka dol nirikooŋ n tar so’oh ni dambana, nirikooŋa da zɛ’ɛl la malemadem kpɛɛnam ni gban-mi’irib la ni teŋ la kpɛɛnam sa’ani na. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Geudas da deŋ ko’ ni ba yii, bam paa ba sa’ani, &lt;&lt;So ka n gaat kɔk ka bobig la Ɔŋ n la; gbã’ã mi ni U ni ya tar keŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ba n da serin paa na la u da gaat paa Yezu sa’ani ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Pa’ala!&gt;&gt; ka kɔk U. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ka ba da gbã’ã Yezu gĩ U kankaŋi. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Niriseba n da zɛ’ niŋa la nkɔ̃ da fɔɔ so’o pɛhig malema kpɛɛnam da’aba la nkɔ̃ tobir bah. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Ka Yezu yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yam tar la so’oh ni dambana na yi ya gbã’a Mam a aa N a la naɣayiigaa? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Daar woo ka Mam be Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ni pa’an ni yam, ka ya pu gbã’agim ma. Ka ŋwala wa iŋ yi la dolih mi a aa la n golih se’em Na’ayen gbauŋ la poŋi la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />U nya’andolib la zã’ã da bah U mi ka zo’. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Buribepaalig kakɔ̃ n da lob fugɔbig dol Yezu ka ba da zɛɣit yi ba gbã’agu, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ka u pehig fugɔbig la bah teba ka zo bɛɛli keŋ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu paa gãkir kpɛm la tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ba da tar Yezu paa malemadem tɔɔngat la ni, malemadem kpɛɛnam la, ni teŋ la kpɛɛnam la, ni wara pa’alib la zã’a n da laɣɛh taaba la sa’ani. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita da dol ba nya’aŋ kɔm kɔm ti paa malemadem tɔɔngat la ndɔŋi zĩ ni niriseba n da laɣɛh la ɔɔhit buɣum. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ka malemadem tɔɔngatib ni teŋ la kpɛ’ɛnam la zã’ã da ɛɛt ba n nam nyɛ U taal se’em ka ko’ U, ka’ ba da pu nyɛ se’el se’el la. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Se’el n so la nirib zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ da maɣɛ te Yezu ka ba tɔɣum la zã’ã da pu kpɛ’ɛle. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Seba da dɔɔ niŋa maɣɛ U yela. Ba da yet yii, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Tam wom ka U yet yii, &lt;Mam nan gbi Na’ayen po’ohug dooga ka ba mɛ ni nu’uha bah, ka dabiha atã ni N nan mɛ nkɔ̃ ka nir nu’ug kun si’ihe.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ka bam mi namaɣum la da pu dolih sɔre. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ka malemadem tɔɔngat la da dɔɔ saazugu ba tɔɔm bɔ’ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;I pu tar lebihug nan lebihee? Nan yela n la ka ba yet yi I iŋ ya ka I sinna?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ka U da sin digi digi ka pu lebih yel se’ela. Ka malemadem tɔɔngat la da le bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a fããt laa, Na’ayen Kassidaan Dawɔɔ laa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yezu yel yii, &lt;&lt;Ẽẽ, Maan la; ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">&lt;ya nan nyɛ Asaal Dawɔɔ ka U zĩ Paŋ-waabi Daan la dituŋ nu’ug,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">ka &lt;kenna ni tensoŋ sangbana.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ka malemadem tɔɔngat la ããh u mɛŋ fuug la bah ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yela ka ti le ɛɛt sɛheranam ya’aha? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ya wom Un to’ Na’ayen! Yam tẽ’ẽha deni?&gt;&gt; Ka ba zã’ã tɔɣɔ ko yi U a la ba ko’. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Niŋa ka bam baseba pĩ’ĩl tobihit nantɔ̃ɔ̃t ma’at U ka pĩ U nini ka ŋmɛ’ɛt U tampẽgih ka yet U yii, &lt;&lt;Bokum so n ŋmɛ’ɛt I wa!&gt;&gt; Ka ntomerib seba n gur U la dɛ’ɛ U ni bo’ot.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Zi’ih Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pita da kpelin be ndɔŋ la ni ka malemadem tɔɔngat la pɔɣɔsɔɔg da kpɛ̃ na. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ka un da nyɛ Pita n da ɔɔhit buɣum la, u da beh u ki’i ka bɔ’ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ mi daa laɣum be mi ni Yezu Nazarɛt buraa la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ka Pita ki’ih ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam pu mi bee, bɔk nyɛ n tɔɣɔt se’el laa.&gt;&gt; Ka keŋ yi zanɔrin ha, ka nɔrɔɔg kaah. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ka pɔɣɔsɔɔg la n da le nyɛ u ka u zɛ la, ka u da yel niriseba n zɛ niŋa la yii, &lt;&lt;Burakãã a la ba nkɔ̃.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ka Pita le ki’ih. Ka la iŋ bɛ’ɛla ka seba n zɛ niŋa la nkɔ̃ yel Pita yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ serin a la ba nkɔ̃, se’el n so la i zɛ’ɛl la Galilii teŋ na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ka Pita le lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Mam poya yi mam pu mi buraaga ka ya tɔɣɔra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Niŋa ka nɔrɔɔg kaah pa’ah buyi. Ka Pita pana tẽẽ yi Yezu daa yel yii, &lt;&lt;I nan ti ki’ih Mam suɣum butã ka nɔrɔɔg nyaan kaah pa’ah buyi.&gt;&gt; Ka u da pana lu teŋ fiɣimit ni nkuma.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu be Palet tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ka beog n da kãhig la, malemadem tɔɔngat la ni malemadem kpɛɛnam la ni teŋ la kpɛɛnam la ni wara pa’alib la zã’ã da laɣɛh zi’in nyɛ taaba. Ba da tɔɣɔ ko nɔɔr yi ba lo Yezu tar ti te Palet. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Palet da bɔ’ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a Geudem Na’ab laa?&gt;&gt; ka U lebih yii, &lt;&lt;I yel la yela wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Malemadem tɔɔngatib la da zɛrig Yezu mi ni yela zɔ’ɔ zɔ’ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Yela ka Palet le bɔ’ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;I ka lebihug nan lebihee? Behum yelese’a zã’ã ka ba tar ziin I waa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ka Yezu da pu lebih yel se’el se’el la, ka la da iŋ Palet pakir.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Palet zaŋ Yezu teh yi ba Kpa U Mpuuredɔɔg zugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ba Azɔɔgaat malema daar la n da ni ti paagit, na’ab la da ni wo’oga nir nkɔ̃ ba sãrega doog la ni bah, nirib la mɛŋ mi n ni pa’al nir so ka ba bɔɔt yi u wo’o bah ka u bah u daan. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Yela ma’a la, ba nirib mɛŋ baseba n da dɔɔ zabir ni teŋ la kpɛɛnam la ka ba da gbã ba wo sãrega ni, ba nkɔ̃ da a la Barabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Nirikooŋ la da laɣɛh Palet sa’ani na yet u yi u bah paɣarib la nkɔ̃ a aa ba malema la n pa’al se’em la. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Ka u da pana lebih bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya bɔɔt yi m bah la Geudem Na’ab la te yaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />U da mi yi ŋwũũr zugu ka malema kpɛɛnam la da gbã’ã Yezu na te u. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ka malema kpɛɛnam la da pẽẽl nirikooŋ la gãɣat yet Palet yi u bah Barabas te ba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Ka Palet le bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya pana bɔɔt yi n iŋ Yezu so ka ya bɔɔn yi Geudem Na’ab la la yela?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ka ba tãhit lebihit ha yii, &lt;&lt;kpa'am U mpuuredɔɔg zugu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Ka Palet leb bɔ’ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;La n zugo, U toma toombekoni?&gt;&gt; Ka ba malengin nyirig gaat yela yet yii, &lt;&lt;kpa'am U mpuuredɔɔg zugu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Ka Palet n da bɔɔt yi u iŋ se’el n nan pɛɛ nirikooŋ la poo la u da yih Barabas te ba, ka bah ka ba bo’ Yezu ka pana zaŋ U te ba yi ba tar keŋ ti kpa mpuuredɔɔg zugu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soogɛnam la Kɛh Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Soogɛnam la da tar Yezu kpɛ̃ na’ab la yir ndɔŋi ka bɔɔl ba taab la zã’ã laɣɛh. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ba da pana zaŋ fuzẽ’ẽog yɛɛl U ka zaŋ gɔ̃’ɔ̃h woɣɛ muŋ vugul U zugu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ba da pana pĩ’ĩl U ẽrigir tɔɔt nɔba po’ohit U ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Naa, Geudem Na’abaa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ba da ŋmɛ’ɛt U zugu ni dɔɔr ka tobihit nantɔ̃ɔ̃t ma’at U, ka kpã’ãt duna teŋ lut vã’ã vã’ã yi bam na’ahit U mi. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ba n da ẽẽrig U ŋwala ba’ah la, ba da yɛɛ fuzẽ’ẽog la ka ba zaŋ yɛɛl U la mi ka zaŋ U mɛŋ laɣɛt la lebih yɛ U. Ba pana da tar U yi keŋ yi ba ti kpa.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Mpuuredɔɔg zugu Kpa’a la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ba n da yɛ ni Yezu la, ba da to’oh la saan ka u kpɛ̃’ɛ̃t teŋ la ni na, ka ba da pẽrig u yi u soŋ Yezu zi U mpuuredɔɔg la. Buraaga wo’or da a la Simɔn n yi Saarin teŋ na ka u biih a Alɛkzanda ni Rufus la. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ba da pana tar Yezu paa zĩse’e m bɔɔn Golegota (di vɔ̃ɔ̃r aa zuŋmalenŋmana teŋ). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ba da zaŋ daam gẽrig ni tiim te Yezu yi U ŋwũ ka U da zaɣah. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ka ba pana kpa U mpuuredɔɔg la zugu ka zaŋ U laɣɛt la ŋmɛ gbaŋa yi ba beh so n nan dɛ’ɛ laɣɛse’eog. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />La da a la beogin kariha awai ka ba kpa U. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ba da golih Un gɛ̃ɛ̃h wara se’em la label mpuuredɔɔg la yii: &lt;&lt;GEUDEM NA’AB LA.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ba mi da laɣun kpa Yezu mi ni naɣayii siyi, kakɔ̃ U dituŋ nu’ug, ka nkɔ̃ U gɔbig. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ka Na’ayen yelesoma la golihug la da pirig nɛɛ poyii yii, &lt;&lt;Ba kããl U pa’ah seba m pu dol wara la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Niriseba n da dol niŋa gat la, da behit Yezu ka lobera zut ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Aa! Nyɛ so n yet yi I nan gbi Na’ayen po’ohug doog la bah ka leb mɛ ku dabiha atã poŋi laa, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />fããgim I mɛŋ, ka sigi mpuuredɔɔga ni na!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Yela nɔɔ ka malemadem tɔɔngatib la ni wara pa’an pa’alib la mi da ẽrigit U yet yii, &lt;&lt;U fããra seba bahit, ka kun tɔ’ɔn fãã U meŋa. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Bahum ka Fããt la, Izirɛal Na’ab la sigi mpuuredɔɔga zugu nan nan na, niŋa ka ti nan nyɛ ka sak sera.&gt;&gt; Seba ka ba da laɣum kpa ni U la mi da kɛɛrit Yezu mi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kum la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />La n da ti paa wuntɛɛŋ zugu tinsok la, lik da tana pĩ teŋ la zã’ã gbariti ti paa kariha atã. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ka la n da paa kariha atã la, Yezu da kaah ni nkɔr kpɛ’ɛmir yet yii, &lt;&lt;Iloi, Iloi, Lama Sabatani?&gt;&gt; ka di vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la, &lt;&lt;Mam Na’ayene, Mam Na’ayene, la n zugu ka I bah Mam?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Seba n da dol niŋa gat ka wom la, da yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;womih mi nii! U bɔɔna Ilaagɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ka ba nkɔ̃ zo keŋ ti iŋ dami’ihug iŋ soosoo niŋa, zaŋ lo dibir ni zɛ̃k ti iŋ Yezu nɔɔrin yi U ŋwũ, ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Aain ki’i, bah mi ka te beh nyaa Ilaagɛ mɛŋ nan tana tar U sigi naa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ka Yezu kaah suppi ka vo’oh U vo’ohug zã’ã fɛ̃uu ka kpi. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Sankaŋ ma’a la, fuse’eog ka ba da zaŋ wul bɔkit Na’ayen po’ohug doog la ãã saazugu ti paa teŋ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Soogɛ-kpɛɛm la n da zɛ niŋa ka nyɛ Yezu n kpi se’em la da yet yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir, burakãã wa serin a la Na’ayen Dawɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bompɔɣɔh mi n da zɛ nkpeŋ ka won se’el woo n da it la ka ba poŋi, Mɛɛri Magedalin ni Mɛɛri so n da a Gemis n a bii la, Gosis ni Salomi nam ma’ la da laɣum be niŋa. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Yezu n da be Galilii teŋ la, ba da dol U mi ka soŋit U; ba berigu da dol ni Yezu mi tã Geruzalɛm na.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Laagir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Zaanɔɔr n da ma’agit la ka mi a Na’ayen dabihir la maahuŋ daar ka ayim beogin nan a Na’ayen dabihir la, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Geuzɛf n a Aramatiya nir ka mi le a kpɛɛnam la nkɔ̃ la, ka mi da mahum gur Na’ayen so’olum la da iŋ sũkãbir keŋ Palet sa’ani soh yi u bah ka u yak Yezu niŋ la laa. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ka Palet a sɛɣɛliŋu un da wom yi Yezu ta’an kpi mi la; ka u da bɔɔl soogɛnam la nkɔ̃ bɔ’ɔh yi u baŋ nyaa Yezu la serin kpi yaa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ka un da wom soogɛ la sa’ani yi U kpi ya la, u da te Geuzɛf sɔr yi u tɔ’ɔn yak kum la. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Geuzɛf da da’ fugɔbig zaŋ pɔb kum la ka u yak la, laa wɔse’eog ka u poɣun da deŋ tũ dɔ’ɔl la. Ka da bilik sɛtaŋ ligil ku nɔɔr. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mɛɛri Magedalin ni Mɛɛri so n a Gosis ma’ la, da nyɛ ba n da laa kum la zĩ’ĩ.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Vo’ogum Kum Poŋi Dɔɔ la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Geudem vo’ohug daar la n da gaat ka beog yelik la, Mɛɛri Magedalin ni Mɛɛri so n da a Gemis ni Salomi nam ma’ la, da zaŋa kpaam n tar wũsoŋ yi ba keŋ ti sɔ̃ɔ̃h Yezu ningbiŋ la. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />La da a lahir daar beogin wo’oŋ wo’oŋ ka ba da keŋ wɔɔg la ni. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ban da yɛ la, ba da bɔ’ɔhit taaba yii, &lt;&lt;ɔn n nan ti bilik sɛtaŋ la te ti?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ban da zɛ̃k zut la, ba nyɛ ka sɛtaŋ la, n kãrig ka tebig yela la, poɣun deŋ bilik mi dɔ ha. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ka ban sigi wɔɔg la poŋi la, ba nyɛ ka buribepaalig zĩ dituŋ nu’ug bɔba, yɛ fupɛɛlik, ka la iŋ ba pakir. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ka u da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da bahin ka la a pakir tet ya; ka mam mi yi ya ɛɛra Yezu n yi Nazarɛt na la, so ka ba daa kpa mpuuredɔɔg zugu la. U pu be kpelaa, U vo’o dɔɔ mi. Behimi zĩse’e ka ba daa laa U la n la ha. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ka kemi, ti yel U nya’andolib la ni Pita yii, U deŋ ya tɔɔn yɛ Galilii ha, niŋa ya nan ti nyɛ U a aa Un daa yet ya se’em la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ka ba do wɔɔg la ni zot ka gbi’it, ka pu yel so so se’el se’el la, dabɛɛm n da sãã ba la zugu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">MAK GI’I BA’AHUG LA</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[Ba da yel seba n da gilig Pita la se’el woo ka ba nar yi ba yel la ŋwala gi’i. Ka ŋwala wa n da ba’ah la, Yezu mɛŋ da tom ba yi ba ke ka Na’ayen yelesomir la n a wolam ka ka ba’ahug la paa tengbauŋa gɔbig ni ku dituŋ zã’ã ka nirib nyɛ fããgir.]<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MAK WƆƔƐRI BA’AHUG LA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Nɛɛ U mɛŋ te Mɛɛri Magedalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[Un da vo’o dɔɔ lahir daar beogin beogin la, U da nɛɛ U mɛŋ yiiga te la Mɛɛri Magedalin, so ka U da kar kolekpãbɛ’ɛh siyopoi yih u ningbina ni bah la. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ka Mɛɛri wa da yi keŋ yel seba n da ni be ni Yezu la, ka da pana fabin ka kumit. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ka ba n da wom yi U vo’o mi ka ɔŋ nyɛ U la, ba da pu sak seraa.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Nɛɛ U mɛŋ te Nya’andolib Bayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ŋwala wa n da iŋ gaat la, Yezu da tɛɛ U nindaa ka nɛɛ U mɛŋ te ba bayi n da be sɔr zugu ken yɛ yit tembil kakɔ̃ ni ha la. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ka bam mi n da leb la, ba da yel ba taab la, ka ba da pu sak sera te baa.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu te U Nya’andolib la Sɔr yi Ba Pĩ’ĩl ba tooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Nya’aŋ ka U nya’andolib pii ni nkɔ̃ la, da laɣun taaba zĩ dit ka Yezu da nɛɛ U mɛŋ te ba. U da ŋwɔm ba mi, bam pu tar sera sakir ka mi le tar tob kpa’aug la, den zugu, bam n da pu sak sera te seba n da nyɛ Ɔŋ n vo’o U mɛŋ dɔɔ la. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi kpɛ̃ tengbauŋa ni ka loɣa zã’ã, ti tɔɔlum Na’ayen yela te nir woo. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />So n sak sera ka dɛ’ɛ soob nan nyɛ fããgir, ka so n pu sak sera nan nyɛ namihug Na’ayen sa’ani. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Yelenyalin ãã wa nan dol seba n sak sera ka tar Mam wo’or tomit la, ba nan kat kolekpãbɛ’ɛh nirib sa’ani bahit; ba nan tɔɣɔt tɔɣum buuri buuri; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />ba n gbã bombɛ’ɛh ni ba nu’uh se’el kun iŋ baa, ban ŋwũ yabik se’el se’el kun iŋ baa, ban zaŋ ba nu’uh paɣɛl ba’anam zut ka po’oh te ba, ba nan nyɛ nima’ahum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu N Do Na’ayen Zugu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Yezu, Daan la n da tɔɣɔ te ba ba’ah la, U da do la tensoŋi ha ti zi’in Na’ayen dituŋ nu’ug. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ka U nya’andolib la da yi tɔɔn Na’ayen yela la zĩ’ĩ woo ka ba keŋ, ka Daan la da serin tomit ni ba ka yelenyalima dol ba a aa Ɔŋ n da yel ba se’em la nɔɔ.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>